WEBVTT

00:18.010 --> 00:20.770
<b>The world is amidst the Great Pirate Era.</b>

00:21.060 --> 00:26.550
<b>In pursuit of fame, fortune and power,
ambitious souls take to the sea.</b>

00:27.190 --> 00:30.740
<b>For pirates, it's an era that is like a dream.</b>

00:31.240 --> 00:36.200
<b>But among them, there are those
who seek only to plunder...</b>

00:36.700 --> 00:43.280
<b>And for the powerless, it means
an age of relentless oppression.</b>

00:44.000 --> 00:49.750
<b>Even the Navy, working at the behest of the
World Government, can not help everyone...</b>

00:50.800 --> 00:54.010
<b>So who can the oppressed turn to?</b>

00:54.510 --> 00:57.720
<b>On what can they pin
their hopes for salvation?</b>

00:58.720 --> 01:00.390
<b>We're in a real fix...</b>

01:00.510 --> 01:04.020
<b>No one's looking out for folks like us.</b>

01:05.060 --> 01:07.900
<b>I cry all the time lately...</b>

01:09.060 --> 01:12.780
<b>Everyone agrees:
the Navy is bad, but what's worse is...</b>

01:12.900 --> 01:14.990
<b>I'm hungry!</b>

01:15.110 --> 01:18.490
<b>What did you expect?
The pirates took everything.</b>

01:18.620 --> 01:20.120
<b>That's right! It's the pirates' fault!</b>

01:20.240 --> 01:21.950
<b>Because of them being so greedy...</b>

01:22.080 --> 01:24.080
<b>No one gets to have fun anymore!</b>

01:27.460 --> 01:29.290
<b>Do you understand what we're going through?</b>

01:29.920 --> 01:32.550
<b>Please. We're suffering...</b>

01:33.170 --> 01:35.840
<b>You're the only one.
The only one who can help...!</b>

01:36.010 --> 01:37.720
<b>--Please.
--You can fix this...</b>

01:37.840 --> 01:39.890
<b>--I'm begging you.
--You're only only hope!</b>

01:40.010 --> 01:40.930
<b>Please!</b>

01:42.060 --> 01:44.980
<b>I know. I know, everyone.</b>

01:45.480 --> 01:50.730
<b>I'm going to create a new age
where you can all be happy.</b>

02:15.300 --> 02:17.630
<b>This is one huge crowd.</b>

02:17.760 --> 02:21.220
<b>Well, the famous Uta is performing live
in front of a crowd for the first time!</b>

02:21.550 --> 02:25.350
<b>She's only done stuff over Video
Transponder Snails until now!</b>

02:25.720 --> 02:30.150
<b>Uta in person!
And in such an awesome place!</b>

02:30.270 --> 02:32.650
<b>I'm... I'm so...!</b>

02:35.860 --> 02:39.410
<b>There's even merfolk around.
Should be quite a show.</b>

02:39.530 --> 02:41.910
<b>But why are we dressed like this?</b>

02:42.030 --> 02:46.750
<b>Showing up in costume to help hype up
her first show gets you these!</b>

02:46.870 --> 02:48.210
<b>That's why?</b>

02:48.330 --> 02:49.830
<b>I'm looking forward to it.</b>

02:50.040 --> 02:52.840
<b>She's the entire world's
sweetheart, at this point.</b>

02:52.960 --> 02:54.920
<b>Is this chick really that big a deal?</b>

02:55.130 --> 02:59.840
<b>As odd as it might sound coming from
Soul King, her voice is otherworldly.</b>

03:00.050 --> 03:03.800
<b>U! T! A! Uta-chan!</b>

03:03.930 --> 03:04.990
<b>What a loser.</b>

03:06.060 --> 03:10.390
<b>Hey, crap swordsman! Say that again
and I'll cook you up nice and juicy!</b>

03:10.520 --> 03:12.610
<b>I'd like to see you try, Twirly Brow.</b>

03:15.130 --> 03:16.940
<b>Here we go!</b>

03:17.320 --> 03:20.320
<b>Hey! The show's starting, Luffy!</b>

03:22.700 --> 03:26.580
<b><i>We can choose the way of our future</i></b>

03:26.850 --> 03:33.710
<b><i>Try a brand new path...
If I change the world</i></b>

03:34.630 --> 03:42.300
<b><i>If I change the world</i></b>

04:06.240 --> 04:09.100
<b><i>Say goodbye to everyone
who stands against us</i></b>

04:09.120 --> 04:13.000
<b><i>No one has the power to stop a change
that comes through music</i></b>

04:13.450 --> 04:15.820
<b><i>No, you can't stop magic</i></b>

04:17.220 --> 04:19.950
<b><i>Close your eyes and you can see
the future before you</i></b>

04:19.960 --> 04:23.630
<b><i>Every note I sing is bringin' you
closer to your purpose</i></b>

04:24.470 --> 04:28.510
<b><i>Once you're there don't let go</i></b>

04:28.630 --> 04:30.980
<b><i>You wanna play a real game,
unfurl the chain</i></b>

04:31.100 --> 04:33.940
<b><i>Melody strung out like we're
walkin' on a tight rope</i></b>

04:34.060 --> 04:36.700
<b><i>Don't wanna cry,
don't wanna try, wanna forget</i></b>

04:36.700 --> 04:40.940
<b><i>Just let me live inside a dreamland
Wanna be free!</i></b>

04:41.070 --> 04:43.820
<b><i>And let a brand new era dawn</i></b>

04:43.830 --> 04:49.230
<b><i>I know that we can
Create a new world!</i></b>

