<b><i>We can choose the way of our future</i></b>

04:52.950 --> 04:57.420
<b><i>Try a brand new path...
If I change the world</i></b>

04:57.440 --> 05:00.910
<b><i>If I change the world...</i></b>

05:01.050 --> 05:05.510
<b><i>This boundless music brings transformation
Messages in song</i></b>

05:05.690 --> 05:11.180
<b><i>Reach even further
This dream will come true</i></b>

05:11.210 --> 05:12.720
<b><i>I believe in you</i></b>

05:34.080 --> 05:36.790
<b><i>Say goodbye to everything
that's weighing you down</i></b>

05:36.830 --> 05:40.780
<b><i>Transcend beyond reality
 to colorful worlds of music</i></b>

05:41.140 --> 05:43.290
<b><i>We need to keep on rising</i></b>

05:44.960 --> 05:47.740
<b><i>Close your eyes and take my hand
we're runnin' together</i></b>

05:47.760 --> 05:51.470
<b><i>We don't have to live like this, 
I know we can all do better</i></b>

05:52.190 --> 05:56.300
<b><i>I sing for liberation</i></b>

05:56.390 --> 05:59.000
<b><i>You wanna play a real game,
unfurl the chain</i></b>

05:59.020 --> 06:01.780
<b><i>Melody lighting up the path to new horizons</i></b>

06:01.820 --> 06:04.500
<b><i>Don't wanna cry,
don't wanna try, wanna forget</i></b>

06:04.500 --> 06:08.700
<b><i>Just let me live inside a dreamland
Wanna be free!</i></b>

06:08.910 --> 06:11.550
<b><i>And let a brand new era dawn</i></b>

