<b><i>Reach even further</i></b>

06:36.390 --> 06:39.020
<b><i>Reach even further</i></b>

06:39.020 --> 06:40.390
<b><i>A New Genesis</i></b>

07:00.870 --> 07:02.420
<b><i>A New Genesis</i></b>

07:14.560 --> 07:17.930
<b>It's great to finally meet you all! I'm Uta!</b>

07:23.560 --> 07:25.940
<b>Sorry... this is a lot to take in.</b>

07:35.910 --> 07:39.000
<b>Let's all have a great time today!</b>

07:40.620 --> 07:42.740
<b>You boys ready?</b>

07:42.740 --> 07:43.750
<b>Yeah.</b>

07:43.750 --> 07:48.670
<b>Snatch up a star like her
and we'll be rich and famous!</b>

07:49.090 --> 07:51.380
<b>Too bad for you, Uta!</b>

07:51.510 --> 07:56.020
<b>U-T-A! U-T-A! U-T-A!</b>

07:58.390 --> 07:59.390
<b>Whoa, Luffy!</b>

08:03.900 --> 08:06.770
<b>Is this guy after Uta, too?</b>

08:08.190 --> 08:10.240
<b>Hey, I was right!</b>

08:11.280 --> 08:13.160
<b>Uta! You're Uta, aren't you?!</b>

08:14.060 --> 08:15.370
<b>It's me, remember?!</b>

08:15.570 --> 08:16.530
<b>Me?</b>

08:18.430 --> 08:19.950
<b>Wait... Luffy?!</b>

08:20.080 --> 08:22.370
<b>It's been a real long time, Uta!</b>

08:22.580 --> 08:25.000
<b>Luffy!</b>

08:25.130 --> 08:26.570
<b>Wha--?!</b>

08:37.970 --> 08:39.740
<b>--Wait, that straw hat...
--It can't be!</b>

08:39.760 --> 08:40.810
<b>--The fifth Emperor?!
--It can't be!</b>

08:40.840 --> 08:44.270
<b>No way. Uta wouldn't be friends with a pirate!</b>

08:46.360 --> 08:48.650
<b>Luffy knows Uta?</b>

08:48.770 --> 08:51.240
<b>Dammit! He could've introduced us, then!</b>

08:51.360 --> 08:53.650
<b>Why exactly are you so friendly
with Princess Uta--?</b>

08:53.780 --> 08:54.990
<b>Huh?!</b>

08:55.110 --> 08:57.700
<b>'Cause she's Shanks' daughter!</b>

09:07.880 --> 09:09.210
<b>When he says Shanks...</b>

09:09.340 --> 09:11.880
<b>That's one of the Four Emperors.
A major bad guy!</b>

09:12.010 --> 09:13.220
<b>I remember a long time ago...</b>

09:13.340 --> 09:16.680
<b>Yeah. He's the one who attacked Elegia!</b>

09:18.390 --> 09:19.390
<b>Uta...</b>

09:23.140 --> 09:27.100
<b>I had thought it was odd 
that Elegia was the venue...</b>

09:27.230 --> 09:29.110
<b>Because of the old legend?</b>

09:29.230 --> 09:32.900
<b>Right. But this adds a whole new wrinkle to it.</b>

09:37.200 --> 09:38.240
<b>Who're you guys?</b>

09:38.370 --> 09:41.700
<b>So "Red-Haired" Shanks of the Four
Emperors has a daughter?</b>

09:41.830 --> 09:45.160
<b>If it's true, that'd make you
his biggest weakness...</b>

09:45.290 --> 09:46.580
<b>Red-Haired's baby girl!</b>

09:46.710 --> 09:50.790
<b>We fork you over to one the big-name
pirate crews and we'll make a huge profit!</b>

09:50.920 --> 09:55.130
<b>So there you have it.
Sorry, but this concert is canceled!</b>

09:55.550 --> 09:57.550
<b>Heat Beating!</b>

10:02.140 --> 10:04.430
<b>We'll be taking the girl!</b>

10:04.730 --> 10:05.850
<b>It's you...</b>

10:05.980 --> 10:07.060
<b>--Branch!
--Branch?</b>

10:07.190 --> 10:10.150
<b>My name is Brulee! With the Big Mom Pirates!</b>

10:10.270 --> 10:11.480
<b>What about the other guy?</b>

10:11.610 --> 10:15.240
<b>I'm Big Mom a.k.a Charlotte
Linlin's fourth son, Oven.</b>

10:15.360 --> 10:17.820
<b>This looks like fun. I want in!</b>

10:17.950 --> 10:22.700
<b>Seriously! I was curious about the fuss
and got lucky enough to hear the big reveal!</b>

10:23.660 --> 10:27.290
<b>Sorry, Uta, but you're going
to be my gift to Mama!</b>

10:27.970 --> 10:28.650
<b>Hang on.</b>

10:29.640 --> 10:30.400
<b>It'll be okay.</b>

10:30.920 --> 10:31.890
<b>Whoa, woah!</b>

10:31.890 --> 10:35.420
<b>If any of you scumbags are after Uta-chan,
you'll have to go through me!</b>

10:35.550 --> 10:39.760
<b>I can hardly ignore the kind of rogues who
would interrupt such a stirring performance.</b>

10:39.890 --> 10:42.930
<b>Now this is my idea of entertainment!</b>

10:43.060 --> 10:46.680
<b>Don't mess with the Jellyfish Pirates!</b>

10:47.020 --> 10:49.640
<b>Song of Scratches... Blizzard Slice!</b>

10:51.690 --> 10:53.150
<b>Kraken Fist!</b>

10:56.190 --> 10:57.070
<b>I guess we're doing this!</b>

10:57.190 --> 10:59.570
<b>The show's just getting started!</b>

10:59.700 --> 11:02.450
<b>Let's get it on! We're gonna protect Uta!</b>

11:02.570 --> 11:06.580
<b>Fishman Karate! Spear Wave!</b>

11:09.620 --> 11:12.830
<b>I can super take it from here!</b>

11:16.250 --> 11:20.180
<b>Gum-Gum... Jet Gatling!</b>

11:22.680 --> 11:25.560
<b>Cien Fleurs! Spider Net!</b>

11:26.350 --> 11:27.520
<b>Alrighty!</b>

11:27.930 --> 11:29.430
<b>Okay! That's enough!</b>

11:29.560 --> 11:34.020
<b>Luffy, guys, thanks for protecting me!
But no more brawling!</b>

11:34.150 --> 11:35.380
<b>You think this is just a brawl?!</b>

11:35.390 --> 11:39.070
<b>You're all my fans, so I want you all
enjoying the show and getting along!</b>

11:39.900 --> 11:43.700
<b>But these guys are trying
to kidnap you, Princess Uta!</b>

11:43.820 --> 11:46.740
<b>And they don't seem like the reasonable type!</b>

11:46.870 --> 11:50.080
<b>When we want something, we fight to take it!</b>

11:50.210 --> 11:51.920
<b>Because we're pirates!</b>

11:52.040 --> 11:53.880
<b>So stop being pirates, then.</b>

11:54.000 --> 11:57.130
<b>I'll forgive all the bad stuff
you've done until now.</b>

11:57.250 --> 12:00.760
<b>Why don't all of you give up
this nasty pirate business</b>

12:00.880 --> 12:04.470
<b>and join me in a world
with tons of fun instead?</b>

12:05.640 --> 12:09.390
<b>With my songs, we can all
be happy and enjoy peace!</b>

12:12.020 --> 12:14.350
<b>There's no such thing as peace, girl.</b>

12:14.480 --> 12:17.480
<b>If you wanna keep yapping,
I can slice your face up!</b>

12:17.610 --> 12:20.400
<b>Hang on! She belongs to me.</b>

12:20.530 --> 12:22.240
<b>--Uta!
--It's fine.</b>

12:22.780 --> 12:25.620
<b>Come on, I thought you all came
here to enjoy my singing.</b>

12:26.570 --> 12:30.580
<b>We're pirates, baby. There's stuff that
matters to us more than music!</b>

12:31.040 --> 12:31.960
<b>This is awful!</b>

12:32.110 --> 12:33.580
<b>They're ruining the concert...</b>

12:33.590 --> 12:36.040
<b>They don't care how Uta or any of us feel.</b>

12:36.500 --> 12:37.790
<b>What a shame.</b>

12:38.130 --> 12:40.050
<b>In that case, I'll make a song out of you.</b>

12:46.300 --> 12:53.020
<b><i>Now, let worry fall away
No fear allowed to stay</i></b>

12:53.090 --> 12:58.030
<b><i>My dream is now your wish
And my hope is never-ending</i></b>

12:58.060 --> 13:03.000
<b><i>When clouds build up inside
My song can clear the sky</i></b>

13:03.100 --> 13:09.090
<b><i>You know I'm invincible
Everything is alright</i></b>

13:17.100 --> 13:22.040
<b><i>My voice carries birds in flight
With ev'ry note, they go higher and higher</i></b>

13:22.180 --> 13:26.960
<b><i>See how I move with such grace
Just like a dancer on the stage</i></b>

13:27.220 --> 13:32.230
<b><i>Your voice carries life within
Calls me to action again and again</i></b>

13:32.530 --> 13:35.810
<b><i>If you're hurt and you need me
I'll always be there, I swear</i></b>

13:35.830 --> 13:37.220
<b><i>I'll always protect you</i></b>

13:37.230 --> 13:41.860
<b><i>We'll have the chance to go
to brand new heights</i></b>

13:41.980 --> 13:46.660
<b><i>You and I, unstoppable when we're together
We can have it all</i></b>

13:46.990 --> 13:49.200
<b><i>A fire burns within in our hearts</i></b>

13:49.530 --> 13:55.410
<b><i>Now, let's go hand in hand
To a light that lies ahead</i></b>

13:55.540 --> 13:59.500
<b><i>All of hopes and dreams
Can bring happiness when we're in sync</i></b>

13:59.630 --> 14:05.340
<b><i>I've always felt this warmth from you
No one gives affection like you do</i></b>

14:05.470 --> 14:11.640
<b><i>You make me invincible
When you're here by my side</i></b>

14:12.760 --> 14:18.100
<b><i>Strong with you by my side</i></b>

14:20.980 --> 14:25.280
<b>Okay, guys, those bad pirates
are now apart of a fun song!</b>

14:25.400 --> 14:28.070
<b>Everything should be fine now, so you can relax!</b>

14:33.160 --> 14:37.290
<b>That's right! They might be family,
but Uta is nothing like Shanks!</b>

14:37.410 --> 14:38.790
<b>Thank goodness!</b>

14:38.920 --> 14:41.500
<b>You're real strong now, Uta!</b>

14:50.010 --> 14:52.350
<b>She's gotta have some kind of power, right?</b>

14:52.470 --> 14:54.640
<b>Not that I'm aware of, but maybe...</b>

14:54.760 --> 14:56.680
<b>What the heck is this?</b>

14:56.810 --> 14:59.390
<b>What're you doing? Let's get back to our seats!</b>

15:02.150 --> 15:04.980
<b>Now, I've got some great news
to share with you all!</b>

15:06.650 --> 15:12.040
<b>I would always get tired during the streaming 
concerts with Video Transponder Snails,</b>

15:12.060 --> 15:13.490
<b>so they tended to be pretty short...</b>

15:13.780 --> 15:17.290
<b>But this concert is an endless one!
It's gonna keep going, non-stop!</b>

15:18.250 --> 15:21.670
<b>That's right! We can be together, forever!</b>

15:21.960 --> 15:26.170
<b>Everybody watching the broadcast
and everyone here at the venue!</b>

15:26.300 --> 15:28.090
<b>Let's all keep having a great time!</b>

15:32.180 --> 15:35.970
<b>This is crazy! She's gonna do
a non-stop solo show?!</b>

15:36.100 --> 15:37.270
<b>How cool is that?!</b>

15:37.720 --> 15:42.110
<b>U-T-A! U-T-A! U-T-A!</b>

15:42.120 --> 15:48.530
<b>U-T-A! U-T-A! U-T-A! U-T-A...!</b>

15:48.650 --> 15:51.150
<b>And there's one other thing I need to say.</b>

15:51.450 --> 15:55.530
<b>To all you pirates, the Navy,
and to the people at the World Government.</b>

15:55.660 --> 15:57.370
<b>do not try to stop this concert.</b>

15:57.910 --> 16:01.460
<b>Everyone is looking for fun
and things to make them happy.</b>

16:01.580 --> 16:04.330
<b>If you ruin that... there'll be consequences.</b>

16:04.670 --> 16:07.590
<b>I'm Uta, the woman who's
going to create a new age.</b>

16:07.750 --> 16:09.800
<b>And I'm going to use my songs
to make everyone happy!</b>

16:12.430 --> 16:15.260
<b>Okay, let's move to the next number.</b>

16:18.450 --> 16:28.300
<b>Highest Authorities of the World Government</b>

16:18.450 --> 16:28.300
<b>The Five Elders</b>

16:18.600 --> 16:20.680
<b>Red-Haired had a Daughter all along, eh?</b>

16:20.810 --> 16:23.230
<b>Cipher Pol's report was accurate.</b>

16:23.350 --> 16:28.230
<b>This is a new threat, one that's
opposed to the Great Pirate Era.</b>

16:28.360 --> 16:32.280
<b>The real problem is how she has popular support.</b>

16:32.400 --> 16:36.070
<b>We should end any seeds of
rebellion before it's too late.</b>

16:36.200 --> 16:39.910
<b>Even if this girl is of Figarland Blood?</b>

16:40.370 --> 16:43.750
<b>I'm concerned about the presence
of Tot Musica as well.</b>

16:44.210 --> 16:45.920
<b>Tot Musica...</b>

16:46.170 --> 16:51.720
<b>With the threat it poses if awoken,
we can't afford to be cautious.</b>

16:54.470 --> 16:57.720
<b>Yeah. The order to subdue Uta has just come in.</b>

16:57.850 --> 16:59.140
<b>She's too damn dangerous.</b>

16:59.260 --> 17:05.100
<b>It's funny enough that a single girl
has the whole world's attention.</b>

17:05.520 --> 17:07.730
<b>Hey! You better not take her lightly!</b>

17:08.190 --> 17:10.730
<b>The target's on the island of Music, Elegia.</b>

17:10.860 --> 17:14.820
<b>The same spot where Tot Musica
was sealed away in ancient times.</b>

17:15.030 --> 17:17.280
<b>And what kind of numbers are we sending?</b>

17:17.660 --> 17:20.790
<b>How many ships are ready to set sail for Elegia?</b>

17:21.120 --> 17:22.370
<b>Thirty.</b>

17:22.500 --> 17:26.330
<b>Good! Send them all,
loaded for bear with troops!</b>

17:27.670 --> 17:28.770
<b>--In the event of Transponder Snail interference,
orders from the flagship will be issued</b>

17:28.770 --> 17:31.630
<b>--Code has been issued to crews already and orders
are to prepare response flags immediately.
--In the event of Transponder Snail interference,
orders from the flagship will be issued</b>

17:31.630 --> 17:39.350
<b>--Code has been issued to crews already and orders
are to prepare response flags immediately.
--using the flag signals notated under
Code 044 in the Signal Book...</b>

17:48.980 --> 17:52.280
<b>Okay, are any of you hungry?</b>

17:52.820 --> 17:57.320
<b>In that case, I'm gonna make plenty
of food and other stuff to enjoy!</b>

18:00.460 --> 18:02.290
<b>Can I really keep it?</b>

18:02.410 --> 18:03.580
<b>Of course!</b>

18:03.700 --> 18:06.870
<b>I want you all to eat whenever you want,
wherever you want!</b>

18:07.000 --> 18:11.380
<b>Sing and dance with me and have a good time!</b>

18:11.630 --> 18:12.960
<b>It's like a dream...</b>

18:13.250 --> 18:16.340
<b>Stick with me and all your
dreams will come true!</b>

18:16.470 --> 18:19.680
<b>There's nothing to scare us anywhere!</b>

18:19.890 --> 18:22.220
<b>This new age is the greatest!</b>

18:29.230 --> 18:34.230
<b>Her power's even greater than expected!
I suppose we've underestimated her.</b>

18:36.650 --> 18:43.700
<b>And on top of that, she's Red-Haired's daughter?
I want her, no matter what it takes.</b>

18:43.830 --> 18:47.410
<b>Those pain-in-the-neck Straw
hats are with her, too!</b>

18:47.540 --> 18:50.040
<b>I'd like to see them try and take me on. Lick!</b>

18:50.330 --> 18:52.090
<b>I'll go to Elegia.</b>

18:54.750 --> 18:58.800
<b>I'm not going to stay quiet
when she's captured my sister.</b>

19:02.010 --> 19:04.310
<b>This place is a real chef's paradise.</b>

19:04.430 --> 19:06.560
<b>I asked Uta for booze and she whipped it up.</b>

19:06.680 --> 19:10.060
<b>I know! I bet we could ask her
to create all kinds of treasure.</b>

19:10.190 --> 19:12.230
<b>How do you think her powers work?</b>

19:12.440 --> 19:14.650
<b>--Woah, there...
--She's a little too versatile</b>

19:14.650 --> 19:16.080
<b>to have just eaten a Devil Fruit.</b>

19:16.320 --> 19:17.780
<b>You've got a point.</b>

19:17.900 --> 19:20.360
<b>I've never heard of powers
capable to be doing all this.</b>

19:20.490 --> 19:24.160
<b>Luffy, you're friends with Uta, right?
Do you know anything?</b>

19:24.450 --> 19:28.200
<b>She always really loved singing!</b>

19:28.830 --> 19:29.170
<b>Huh?</b>

19:31.170 --> 19:38.210
<b>Perhaps Uta has been gifted with
almighty powers from the gods of music!</b>

19:38.340 --> 19:40.550
<b>Luffy. Guys. You having fun?</b>

19:40.680 --> 19:42.470
<b>Yes, Princess Uta!</b>

19:42.590 --> 19:45.510
<b>With all these unusual ingredients?
This place is heaven!</b>

19:45.810 --> 19:47.930
<b>There's so much fun stuff!</b>

19:48.060 --> 19:51.520
<b>I'm glad I could make Luffy's friends happy.</b>

19:52.310 --> 19:53.670
<b>Hey, is this everyone?</b>

19:54.000 --> 19:54.460
<b>Yep.</b>

19:54.530 --> 19:56.700
<b>That can't be right. That hat belongs to--</b>

19:56.830 --> 19:57.920
<b>This is everybody!</b>

19:59.690 --> 20:01.860
<b>It's been a while, Luffy,
so how about another game?</b>

20:01.990 --> 20:04.620
<b>There's no way you can beat me now.</b>

20:04.740 --> 20:08.580
<b>What are you talking about?
I'm on a 183-game-long winning streak!</b>

20:08.750 --> 20:11.920
<b>Wrong! I won those 183 times!</b>

20:12.210 --> 20:14.210
<b>Those are extremely divergent perspectives.</b>

20:14.330 --> 20:15.630
<b>What kind of game?</b>

20:16.040 --> 20:20.970
<b>Luffy and I used to compete all the time.
At knife throwing, arm wrestling...</b>

20:21.300 --> 20:24.260
<b>Okay! This is what we're gonna do today!</b>

20:29.890 --> 20:30.850
<b>Whoa!</b>

20:31.810 --> 20:34.690
<b>It's a game of chicken!
Whoever eats fastest wins.</b>

20:34.980 --> 20:37.900
<b>Oh, I remember this! That just leaves...</b>

20:38.020 --> 20:40.610
<b>Don't worry. I've got it covered!</b>

20:43.490 --> 20:44.190
<b>Let's do this!</b>

20:44.270 --> 20:45.010
<b>Ready...</b>

20:45.110 --> 20:46.620
<b>Three, two, one, go!</b>

20:58.750 --> 20:59.260
<b>For you.</b>

21:00.360 --> 21:01.540
<b>Thanks!</b>

21:06.800 --> 21:08.140
<b>Uta won!</b>

21:08.150 --> 21:09.550
<b>She wins!</b>

21:09.680 --> 21:11.560
<b>That was cheap, Uta!</b>

21:13.690 --> 21:14.810
<b>Aw, crap, right into the ocean.</b>

21:22.650 --> 21:26.660
<b>Oh, right! You ate a Devil Fruit, too,
huh, Luffy? Sorry about that!</b>

21:26.780 --> 21:29.240
<b>You cheated back there! I want a do-over!</b>

21:29.370 --> 21:31.120
<b>There you go again, being a sore loser!</b>

21:31.450 --> 21:34.940
<b>And since I won, you better
tell me where Shanks is!</b>

21:34.950 --> 21:35.540
<b>I dunno.</b>

21:35.670 --> 21:38.070
<b>Then why've you got his straw hat?</b>

21:38.300 --> 21:38.960
<b>He let me borrow it.</b>

21:39.000 --> 21:42.260
<b>Hey, question!
Where did you two meet, anyway?</b>

21:42.550 --> 21:47.050
<b>She came to Fusha Village
along with Shanks and his crew!</b>

21:47.180 --> 21:50.010
<b>That's your hometown, isn't it?</b>

21:50.260 --> 21:51.310
<b>Yeah!</b>

21:51.700 --> 21:55.160
<b>12 years ago</b>

21:57.810 --> 21:59.900
<b>Uta's daydreaming again!</b>

22:00.980 --> 22:02.110
<b>You should come up here.</b>

22:02.360 --> 22:03.390
<b>No way! Boring!</b>

22:03.820 --> 22:05.460
<b>I wanna play a game instead!</b>

22:05.700 --> 22:08.280
<b>Honestly, you're such a baby.</b>

22:08.610 --> 22:10.740
<b>In that case, how about...</b>

22:11.080 --> 22:12.490
<b>A game of chicken!</b>

22:14.200 --> 22:16.370
<b>Winner eats the most then runs away.</b>

22:16.500 --> 22:17.330
<b>Yeah!</b>

22:17.460 --> 22:20.290
<b>That's dangerous! Cut that out, you two.</b>

22:20.420 --> 22:21.040
<b>No way!</b>

22:21.110 --> 22:22.440
<b>Uta! Luffy!</b>

22:22.630 --> 22:24.840
<b>Let them have their fun.</b>

22:26.720 --> 22:29.510
<b>This is their idea of serious competition.</b>

22:30.760 --> 22:31.540
<b>Let's do it!</b>

22:31.660 --> 22:32.350
<b>Ready...</b>

22:32.430 --> 22:33.560
<b>Three, two, one, go!</b>

22:35.140 --> 22:37.270
<b>What are they competing over, anyway?</b>

22:37.390 --> 22:40.100
<b>Who's going to become
the bigger pirate, apparently.</b>

22:43.940 --> 22:45.490
<b>Is Luffy gonna win?</b>

22:46.400 --> 22:47.360
<b>Here's some juice.</b>

22:47.920 --> 22:48.700
<b>Thanks!</b>

22:51.280 --> 22:52.200
<b>Luffy!</b>

22:52.330 --> 22:54.790
<b>I can't believe he fell for it again!</b>

22:55.040 --> 22:56.120
<b>You okay?</b>

22:56.250 --> 22:59.210
<b>It's not over!
That didn't settle nothing!</b>

22:59.330 --> 23:00.960
<b>You're being a sore loser again!</b>

23:01.080 --> 23:02.590
<b>Well, you cheated, so you lose!</b>

23:02.790 --> 23:05.460
<b>I'm a pirate! There's no such thing as cheating!</b>

23:05.590 --> 23:08.550
<b>You got careless in a duel
because you're a dumb baby!</b>

23:08.670 --> 23:12.550
<b>It's not like Shanks says
you're a real pirate yet!</b>

23:12.680 --> 23:15.430
<b>Shut up! I'm Shanks' daughter!</b>

23:15.560 --> 23:19.350
<b>Unlike you, I've been sailing and going
on adventures for years now!</b>

23:19.480 --> 23:21.230
<b>That's a huge difference!</b>

23:21.350 --> 23:22.400
<b>--Is not!
--Is, too!</b>

23:22.520 --> 23:25.230
<b>In that case, let's fight to
settle it--like real pirates!</b>

23:25.360 --> 23:26.860
<b>Fine with me!</b>

23:33.050 --> 23:35.120
<b>Give it a rest already.</b>

23:35.240 --> 23:39.460
<b>No real pirate would use
their sword on a kid, Shanks!</b>

23:39.580 --> 23:42.170
<b>Don't be silly, that was just tough love.</b>

23:42.420 --> 23:44.540
<b>But swords are sharp, not tough!</b>

23:44.790 --> 23:49.920
<b>Aw, did you say love?
Does that mean you love me, Shanks?</b>

23:51.270 --> 23:52.980
<b>Shanks!</b>

23:52.980 --> 23:56.140
<b>Uta, Luffy, both of you need
to stop clinging to me!</b>

23:56.430 --> 23:59.640
<b>How come you call your dad "Shanks," anyway?</b>

24:00.390 --> 24:03.560
<b>He might be my dad, but he's also
my captain, and I idolize him!</b>

24:03.690 --> 24:05.230
<b>Isn't he cool?</b>

24:07.440 --> 24:11.860
<b>I'm feeling so good about beating
Luffy again, I think I'll sing!</b>

24:11.990 --> 24:14.370
<b>Shanks, I wanna go sailing, too!</b>

24:14.620 --> 24:17.200
<b>You're too rowdy for my crew.</b>

24:17.330 --> 24:18.160
<b>What about Uta?!</b>

24:18.290 --> 24:22.000
<b>She waits on the ship during battle.
There's no way you could sit still.</b>

24:24.460 --> 24:28.420
<b>That's right! I'm the Red-Haired
Pirates' musician, Uta!</b>

24:28.550 --> 24:32.880
<b>The girl who's gonna use music to make
a new age where everyone will be free!</b>

24:33.010 --> 24:35.720
<b>Pay attention, our musician's taking the stage.</b>

24:41.930 --> 24:48.690
<b><i>Where did it come from
Where could this wind be taking us?</i></b>

24:49.280 --> 24:55.110
<b><i>I look up to the sky hoping for answers
But there is no reply</i></b>

24:55.660 --> 25:02.620
<b><i>Where will it end up,
The song that I've been a vessel for?</i></b>

25:03.040 --> 25:08.960
<b><i>I look within knowing I'll find the answer
Even on my own</i></b>

25:09.840 --> 25:15.550
<b><i>Let's row out to the open sea
far as we can go</i></b>

25:16.220 --> 25:18.850
<b><i>To the unknown</i></b>

25:21.390 --> 25:24.230
<b><i>I've got to keep--</i></b>

25:39.080 --> 25:40.660
<b>Okay, I get to sing next!</b>

25:40.790 --> 25:42.200
<b>All right, let's hear it!</b>

25:46.250 --> 25:49.250
<b>Come to think of it,
you disappeared all of a sudden.</b>

25:51.090 --> 25:53.170
<b>It was sudden? How come?</b>

25:53.630 --> 25:56.050
<b>Let's see... If I can remember right...</b>

25:57.430 --> 26:01.350
<b>I used to wait for Shanks
and his crew to come back.</b>

26:01.600 --> 26:02.970
<b>But one time...</b>

26:03.560 --> 26:04.770
<b>Welcome back!</b>

26:04.980 --> 26:07.340
<b>What kinda adventures did you have this time?</b>

26:07.900 --> 26:09.770
<b>Huh? What's wrong?</b>

26:10.190 --> 26:12.360
<b>Fine, I'll just ask Uta!</b>

26:12.480 --> 26:15.280
<b>Uta! Uta!</b>

26:15.610 --> 26:18.320
<b>I'll listen to you brag about
your adventures again!</b>

26:18.450 --> 26:20.200
<b>Where are you, Uta?!</b>

26:22.370 --> 26:25.250
<b>Shanks? Where'd Uta go?</b>

26:28.620 --> 26:32.130
<b>Did... something happen to her?</b>

26:33.300 --> 26:35.210
<b>Don't worry, Luffy.</b>

26:35.550 --> 26:40.680
<b>Uta left the crew to become
a singer. That's all.</b>

26:44.060 --> 26:47.480
<b>So why'd you stop wanting to be a pirate, Uta?
</b>

26:47.600 --> 26:50.560
<b>You used to love the Red-Haired Pirates so much!</b>

26:52.060 --> 26:55.190
<b>I wanted to be a singer more than a pirate.</b>

26:55.320 --> 26:59.990
<b>I mean, I've already got fans all over 
the world after only two years!</b>

27:01.450 --> 27:03.990
<b>What about you, Luffy? What are you doing now?</b>

27:04.120 --> 27:06.040
<b>Are you joking? I'm a pirate!</b>

27:08.080 --> 27:10.120
<b>Right... You're a pirate, huh?</b>

27:10.370 --> 27:13.090
<b>Yeah! And I'm gonna be the King of the Pirates.</b>

27:13.290 --> 27:16.090
<b>Hey, Luffy... You should quit being a pirate.</b>

27:17.240 --> 27:19.380
<b>Why don't you live here, with us, and have fun?</b>

27:19.550 --> 27:24.510
<b>Your friends are all fans of mine, right?
It'd be way better to stay here.</b>

27:24.720 --> 27:27.350
<b>Hey! Are you listening, Luffy?</b>

27:28.810 --> 27:31.600
<b>It was great seeing you again, Uta!</b>

27:31.730 --> 27:34.650
<b>I ate some meat, so I'm gonna head
back to the Sunny and sleep.</b>

27:35.690 --> 27:38.820
<b>Looks like you're doing what
you want, and that's good!</b>

27:38.940 --> 27:39.700
<b>See ya!</b>

27:40.030 --> 27:41.360
<b>I'm not letting you go.</b>

27:42.700 --> 27:46.430
<b>All of you, and Luffy,
are staying here forever...</b>

27:46.760 --> 27:48.500
<b>Where you're going to have fun, with me.</b>

27:48.620 --> 27:50.370
<b>What the hell are you talking about?</b>

27:50.500 --> 27:54.290
<b>Uta, I love your singing,
but <i>forever</i> is a little--</b>

27:55.380 --> 27:56.710
<b>Nami-san!</b>

27:57.000 --> 28:00.550
<b>Everyone! I found more pirates!</b>

28:00.720 --> 28:01.760
<b>What should I do?</b>

28:04.050 --> 28:05.600
<b>U-T-A!</b>

28:05.720 --> 28:08.680
<b>U-T-A!</b>

28:09.020 --> 28:12.560
<b>U-T-A! U-T-A! U-T-A! U-T-A!</b>

28:13.150 --> 28:14.270
<b>Okay!</b>

28:14.400 --> 28:17.980
<b>I'll take care of the pirates for you, then!</b>

28:29.620 --> 28:34.460
<b>I don't care if you know Luffy,
you're having a little too much fun.</b>

28:38.130 --> 28:39.670
<b>What are these guys?!</b>

28:41.090 --> 28:42.630
<b>There are more and more of them!</b>

28:42.840 --> 28:45.590
<b>Arabesque Brick Fist!</b>

28:49.010 --> 28:51.230
<b>Ouchie Finger!</b>

28:53.230 --> 28:54.230
<b>Luffy...</b>

28:54.940 --> 28:57.610
<b>This is your fault for being a pirate.</b>

28:57.730 --> 29:00.610
<b>If you're really my friend,
then give up on being a pirate.</b>

29:00.900 --> 29:02.290
<b>What are you talking about?!</b>

29:05.070 --> 29:07.280
<b>I'm not doing this. Don't feel like it.</b>

29:07.950 --> 29:09.790
<b>There's no reason for us to fight.</b>

29:10.160 --> 29:12.910
<b>You might not want a fight, but I do!</b>

29:31.180 --> 29:33.560
<b>Seis Fleurs! Slap!</b>

29:38.190 --> 29:40.610
<b>Quit messing around, Uta!</b>

29:41.530 --> 29:47.050
<b><i>My mem'ries so good and awful
 It seems they gave me a grudge</i></b>

29:47.960 --> 29:53.030
<b><i>But I have left bitterness 
and resentment behind me</i></b>

29:53.030 --> 29:54.840
<b><i>And it is all thanks to him</i></b>

29:54.840 --> 29:56.370
<b><i>Look, it's the clowns who think they know</i></b>

29:56.370 --> 29:58.010
<b><i>How crushing loneliness can be</i></b>

29:58.010 --> 30:00.480
<b><i>You know nothing 'til you come with me</i></b>

30:00.500 --> 30:05.070
<b><i>And run wild!
 Release your rage</i></b>

30:05.080 --> 30:07.800
<b><i>Let the winds of wrath blow them away</i></b>

30:07.810 --> 30:10.680
<b><i>Not gonna live in compliance-iance-iance</i></b>

30:10.700 --> 30:13.310
<b><i>I'm not playin' the victim, no more</i></b>

30:13.330 --> 30:18.020
<b><i>Time to go rage 
Let's punish them all</i></b>

30:18.150 --> 30:20.740
<b><i>For their love; I'm done trying to trust</i></b>

30:20.870 --> 30:23.730
<b><i>Not gonna live in compliance-iance-iance</i></b>

30:23.860 --> 30:26.400
<b><i>Gonna play with fire, backlit</i></b>

30:26.530 --> 30:32.740
<b><i>By the flames</i></b>

30:43.250 --> 30:46.840
<b>What the heck are you doing? Let me go!</b>

30:47.050 --> 30:50.300
<b>I can't... let you become the Pirate King.</b>

30:52.680 --> 30:55.640
<b>What do you all think of pirates?</b>

30:56.270 --> 30:58.350
<b>Pirates burnt my city down!</b>

30:59.020 --> 31:01.310
<b>Pirates killed my husband!</b>

31:01.940 --> 31:03.480
<b>Give my mom back!</b>

31:03.610 --> 31:08.570
<b>No more pirates! Throw them out!
No more pirates! Throw them out!</b>

31:08.780 --> 31:12.870
<b>Princess Uta! Luffy would never do that!</b>

31:13.240 --> 31:15.240
<b>Uta, let my crew go--!</b>

31:17.540 --> 31:19.750
<b>Stay away from Uta! Dammed pirate!</b>

31:21.710 --> 31:24.840
<b>Those Devil Fruit powers aren't scary
when you're weakened from seawater!</b>

31:25.050 --> 31:26.510
<b>Hey, stop it!</b>

31:26.630 --> 31:27.530
<b>I can't stand this--</b>

31:27.600 --> 31:28.040
<b>Don't.</b>

31:28.510 --> 31:32.050
<b>It'll be okay. We need to get
ready for the the next phase.</b>

31:32.340 --> 31:34.180
<b>Barrier Ball!</b>

31:36.310 --> 31:38.310
<b>L-Lomeo...?</b>

31:38.430 --> 31:41.190
<b>Luffy-senpai, there's something
real nasty about Uta-sama!</b>

31:41.310 --> 31:43.060
<b>I don't think we can take her!</b>

31:43.270 --> 31:45.690
<b>I haven't... lost... yet!</b>

31:45.860 --> 31:48.650
<b>There you go, being a sore loser!</b>

31:57.540 --> 32:00.250
<b>There were more pirates in hiding, huh?</b>

32:05.460 --> 32:08.210
<b>What the--?! Where the heck are we?!</b>

32:12.430 --> 32:16.060
<b>Oh, so you're a fan of Uta-sama, too, Trafalgar?</b>

32:16.180 --> 32:18.140
<b>Wrong. I'm a chaperone.</b>

32:22.520 --> 32:23.520
<b>For Bepo.</b>

32:23.650 --> 32:24.610
<b>Sorry.</b>

32:24.810 --> 32:27.480
<b>Thanks, Tra-guy!</b>

32:27.690 --> 32:29.690
<b>I wouldn't be laughing, Straw Hat-ya.</b>

32:29.820 --> 32:32.110
<b>If we can't figure out that woman's power--</b>

32:33.990 --> 32:37.200
<b>I'll take care of it! 
I'm on a 184-win streak against Uta!</b>

32:37.330 --> 32:38.700
<b>Oh, there you are!</b>

32:38.990 --> 32:39.950
<b>Found you!</b>

32:40.000 --> 32:42.150
<b>--It's Uta!
--Luffy-senpai!</b>

32:42.150 --> 32:43.250
<b>We're getting out of here for now!</b>

32:43.370 --> 32:44.880
<b>The pirates are running away!</b>

32:45.000 --> 32:47.710
<b>Let's all team up and hunt them down!</b>

33:12.950 --> 33:15.280
<b>The SWORD Transponder Snail's not working.</b>

33:15.410 --> 33:19.120
<b>This is bad. Uta might be serious
about going through with her plan.</b>

33:20.540 --> 33:23.330
<b>So SWORD has their eye on Uta, too?</b>

33:24.160 --> 33:26.750
<b>You're Cipher Pol, right?
What are you doing here?</b>

33:26.960 --> 33:30.460
<b>Save the interjurisdictional quarrels for later!</b>

33:30.670 --> 33:32.630
<b>Can you use your Door-Door ability?</b>

33:32.760 --> 33:34.300
<b>You sure you don't know too much?</b>

33:34.430 --> 33:35.840
<b>No more than you.</b>

33:36.930 --> 33:41.010
<b>I can, but out here, it'd be too big
of a drain on my stamina.</b>

33:41.140 --> 33:42.140
<b>I see...</b>

33:42.270 --> 33:44.640
<b>What's the call? We're running out of time.</b>

33:46.310 --> 33:49.650
<b>We'll recruit more fighters.
For now, that's all we can do.</b>

33:51.110 --> 33:54.240
<b>This sucks! They all got caught!</b>

33:54.820 --> 33:58.700
<b>They're just stuck on those lines,
so it's probably fine, but...</b>

33:58.870 --> 34:02.330
<b>I can't believe I get to
give Luffy-senpai a lift!</b>

34:02.450 --> 34:04.870
<b>I'm so overwhelmed, I can't see in front of me!</b>

34:05.460 --> 34:06.500
<b>Straw Hat!</b>

34:06.860 --> 34:07.500
<b>Thanks.</b>

34:11.170 --> 34:13.630
<b>What are you doing? We need to move!</b>

34:30.640 --> 34:32.400
<b>There're so many of them!</b>

34:32.520 --> 34:34.320
<b>They're gonna surround us for sure!</b>

34:34.440 --> 34:35.820
<b>You boys...</b>

34:45.000 --> 34:47.040
<b>You really saved us!</b>

34:47.500 --> 34:49.020
<b>Your name is Luffy, then?</b>

34:49.280 --> 34:49.920
<b>Yep!</b>

34:50.170 --> 34:51.710
<b>--Then, you're...
--Who're you, old guy?</b>

34:53.050 --> 34:59.300
<b>I am the former ruler of this nation,
Elegia. My name is Gordon.</b>

34:59.510 --> 35:03.970
<b>What nation? This place has got all kinds
of buildings, but there's not a soul around!</b>

35:04.100 --> 35:04.580
<b>No.</b>

35:05.320 --> 35:08.640
<b>Elegia used to be known as the capital
of music for the entire world.</b>

35:09.390 --> 35:11.810
<b>Before everyone who lived
there went missing overnight.</b>

35:12.020 --> 35:14.480
<b>You mean to say a whole country
was gone in one night?</b>

35:14.610 --> 35:17.820
<b>A certain big-name pirate
is rumored to be responsible.</b>

35:25.080 --> 35:27.080
<b>Let me tell you about Uta.</b>

35:27.750 --> 35:32.460
<b>Once Elegia's citizens were gone,
I raised Uta here, alone.</b>

35:32.580 --> 35:33.840
<b>You did?</b>

35:34.170 --> 35:38.090
<b>But it was only the two of us, by ourselves...</b>

35:39.050 --> 35:40.880
<b>I'm sure she was lonely.</b>

35:41.010 --> 35:44.180
<b>She put a brave face on around me,</b>

35:44.300 --> 35:49.730
<b>but whenever she was alone,
she would sing about her lost friends...</b>

35:50.690 --> 35:59.080
<b><i>I recall that day
we played together by the sea</i></b>

35:59.390 --> 36:02.280
<b><i>Just you and me</i></b>

36:02.700 --> 36:11.320
<b><i>Still that scent of ocean seems
to fade each passing day</i></b>

36:11.360 --> 36:14.170
<b><i>It slips away</i></b>

36:14.330 --> 36:20.260
<b><i>So I sing an old familiar song
I hope you know the one</i></b>

36:20.380 --> 36:26.140
<b><i>I will sing to call you back to me</i></b>

36:26.760 --> 36:30.030
<b>--I raised her to be the greatest
singer in the world
--<i>I need you to hear it
Need you to believe in</i></b>

36:30.030 --> 36:32.120
<b>--in an effort to put more joy into her voice.
--<i>I need you to hear it
Need you to believe in</i></b>

36:32.140 --> 36:35.330
<b>--in an effort to put more joy into her voice.
--<i>Something out there...</i></b>

36:37.520 --> 36:39.400
<b>Excuse me?! Are you listening?!</b>

36:39.530 --> 36:41.530
<b>Just keep talking, old timer.</b>

36:45.120 --> 36:46.280
<b>Sorry.</b>

36:46.410 --> 36:51.290
<b>Anyway, I guess that explains how Uta-sama
doesn't know what Luffy-senpai's been up to.</b>

36:53.910 --> 36:54.700
<b>Sorry!</b>

36:57.130 --> 36:59.590
<b>The greatest question I faced
was when and how</b>

36:59.710 --> 37:03.840
<b>to present her sublime singing to the world.</b>

37:04.050 --> 37:08.180
<b>She grew up almost entirely
ignorant of outside affairs...</b>

37:08.850 --> 37:13.600
<b>But then, the time came in a way
I couldn't have anticipated.</b>

37:17.560 --> 37:21.530
<b>It was two years ago...
She stumbled upon something...</b>

37:21.820 --> 37:25.160
<b>A new type of Video Transponder Snail
had washed up on the beach.</b>

37:26.740 --> 37:33.160
<b>Uta started sending her songs beyond the island,
like she had been set free from something.</b>

37:33.500 --> 37:35.670
<b>Her voice charmed many fans,</b>

37:36.290 --> 37:41.460
<b>and spread quickly enough to fill
every corner of the globe.</b>

37:42.340 --> 37:43.920
<b>Thanks, Uta!</b>

37:44.050 --> 37:45.180
<b>I feel better now!</b>

37:45.300 --> 37:49.640
<b>I think I'll make it through another
day tomorrow thanks to you!</b>

37:50.010 --> 37:53.680
<b>Me, too. I'm so glad you all like my singing!</b>

37:56.730 --> 38:01.020
<b>But as she learned about
the state of the outside world,</b>

38:01.150 --> 38:05.280
<b>she started to develop
awareness to something else...</b>

38:05.530 --> 38:08.740
<b>Of how the Great Pirate Era was one
of unending war and bloodshed.</b>

38:10.870 --> 38:14.250
<b>It started with just her singing,</b>

38:14.370 --> 38:19.420
<b>but in time, fans were starting
to hail Uta as some kind of savior.</b>

38:19.880 --> 38:21.550
<b>And Uta, in response...</b>

38:21.750 --> 38:24.460
<b>I understand how all of you feel.</b>

38:24.760 --> 38:27.880
<b>And if that's what you need,
then I'll create a new age for you!</b>

38:28.640 --> 38:31.720
<b>Please! You have to stop Uta's plan!</b>

38:31.850 --> 38:34.730
<b>You were her friend, Luffy!
You should be able to do it!</b>

38:34.890 --> 38:37.140
<b>Does this plan of hers involve the concert--?</b>

38:40.110 --> 38:40.940
<b>Sorry!</b>

38:41.190 --> 38:42.190
<b>Bepo!</b>

38:47.360 --> 38:49.030
<b>--Bepo?!
--The bear!</b>

38:53.950 --> 38:54.700
<b>Uta...</b>

38:55.040 --> 38:58.170
<b>Gordon. What are you doing with these pirates?</b>

38:59.250 --> 39:02.130
<b>Uta, how come you left Shanks' ship?</b>

39:03.800 --> 39:06.760
<b>You said you were the
Red-Haired Pirates' musician.</b>

39:06.880 --> 39:09.180
<b>You could always go back to him!</b>

39:09.340 --> 39:10.640
<b>Shut up...</b>

39:10.890 --> 39:14.640
<b>I don't want to talk about Shanks anymore!</b>

39:25.440 --> 39:26.780
<b>Seriously, Luffy,</b>

39:26.900 --> 39:30.820
<b>Give up the One Piece,
being a pirate king, and Shanks' hat...</b>

39:30.950 --> 39:35.330
<b>Forget all that dumb stuff
and just enjoy life with me!
</b>

39:35.450 --> 39:37.290
<b>Hey! That's going too far!</b>

39:37.410 --> 39:41.370
<b>We could eat all kinds of tasty food,
and play chicken, or arm wrestle!</b>

39:41.500 --> 39:43.460
<b>Just laughing and living our lives,
like we used to.</b>

39:43.670 --> 39:47.050
<b>Give the hat back! That's Shanks' hat!</b>

39:48.630 --> 39:54.010
<b>Fine, Luffy. I don't need you in my new age.</b>

39:54.720 --> 39:56.180
<b>Room! Shambles!</b>

39:59.480 --> 40:00.770
<b>Huh? Where'd they go?</b>

40:00.890 --> 40:02.600
<b>Did the pirates get away?</b>

40:02.730 --> 40:05.940
<b>Huh... I guess there are
all kinds of different powers.</b>

40:06.320 --> 40:11.320
<b>Oh, well! Let's make it a game!
Try to find the runaway pirates!</b>

40:18.660 --> 40:21.410
<b>Let me out! I gotta get my hat back!</b>

40:21.540 --> 40:25.170
<b>Shut up! You're staying in there
<i>because</i> you can't pull that off!</b>

40:25.420 --> 40:27.300
<b>But we can't just keep running...</b>

40:27.460 --> 40:29.380
<b>We'll head to the opposite end
of the island, then to the port.</b>

40:29.510 --> 40:30.220
<b>The port?</b>

40:30.470 --> 40:33.930
<b>There were Marines and intelligence
agents in the audience.</b>

40:34.050 --> 40:35.300
<b>What're they doing here?</b>

40:35.510 --> 40:39.640
<b>It means the World Government and Navy
have already noticed Uta's power</b>

40:39.770 --> 40:41.980
<b>and consider her to be a threat.</b>

40:42.230 --> 40:44.770
<b>They were keeping an eye on her?</b>

40:45.060 --> 40:48.900
<b>If we can find someone near the island
from the Navy and get them to talk,</b>

40:49.030 --> 40:50.440
<b>we might learn how her power--</b>

40:50.570 --> 40:51.740
<b>Wrong way!</b>

40:54.910 --> 40:57.780
<b>Not a problem! My barriers are real strong!</b>

40:57.910 --> 41:00.910
<b>But it keeps rolling!</b>

41:07.790 --> 41:10.210
<b>We're real high!</b>

41:21.930 --> 41:25.150
<b>Luffy-senpai! I'm begging you,
you gotta hold it in!</b>

41:34.280 --> 41:36.570
<b>Hey, Gordon... are you mad?</b>

41:36.700 --> 41:39.410
<b>About me doing this concert without asking you?</b>

41:39.530 --> 41:42.040
<b>It's not just a concert, is it?</b>

41:42.250 --> 41:45.580
<b>You noticed? You'll support me, right?</b>

41:46.880 --> 41:50.340
<b>I... I've...</b>

41:51.210 --> 41:54.380
<b>Must be nice to be able to have
that choice. To chicken out.</b>

41:54.510 --> 41:58.300
<b>I don't want you doing this!</b>

41:58.430 --> 41:59.850
<b>But--</b>

41:59.970 --> 42:01.390
<b>Just wait there for now.</b>

42:01.510 --> 42:04.480
<b>The World Government
and Navy will come after you!</b>

42:04.640 --> 42:07.190
<b>It's fine. Because I have this.</b>

42:08.690 --> 42:11.360
<b>No... Tot Musica!</b>

42:11.780 --> 42:15.990
<b>I knew about how you hid it beneath the castle.</b>

42:16.360 --> 42:18.110
<b>Why didn't you throw it away?</b>

42:18.280 --> 42:22.660
<b>Maybe you were hoping for
the dawn of a new age, too.</b>

42:23.580 --> 42:26.500
<b>Uta! You can't use that! It's--</b>

42:26.670 --> 42:29.040
<b>Uta!</b>

42:33.670 --> 42:37.050
<b>The sea's real big. Real vast.</b>

42:37.340 --> 42:40.220
<b>But I don't see anybody, much less the Navy.</b>

42:40.350 --> 42:41.310
<b>She's gone!</b>

42:41.400 --> 42:41.970
<b>Who is?</b>

42:42.140 --> 42:43.470
<b>The Sunny's missing!</b>

42:43.600 --> 42:45.230
<b>Your ship?!</b>

42:47.350 --> 42:48.730
<b>Sunny!</b>

42:50.520 --> 42:54.780
<b>Sunny... Sunny... Sunny.</b>

42:55.110 --> 42:56.240
<b>Sunny!</b>

42:56.360 --> 42:57.150
<b>No way!</b>

42:57.240 --> 42:59.500
<b>Is that you, Sunny?!</b>

42:59.700 --> 43:02.330
<b>Did Uta-sama's power do this, too?!</b>

43:02.450 --> 43:04.740
<b>I'm seriously freaking out!</b>

43:04.870 --> 43:06.500
<b>Sunny?</b>

43:08.000 --> 43:12.090
<b>Reports are coming in from the forecastle decks:
No sign of the enemy in the vicinity.</b>

43:12.420 --> 43:14.880
<b>--Repeat, no sign of enemies in the vicinity.
--Make sure we haven't been followed.</b>

43:15.050 --> 43:22.140
<b>Armed scouting team one has landed and is moving 
through the ruins. No signs of the enemy.</b>

43:22.260 --> 43:27.020
<b>Armed scouting team two is continuing 
the search, but no trace of the enemy so far.</b>

43:27.230 --> 43:32.400
<b>Mission is underway, but unable
to confirm enemy presence.</b>

43:32.520 --> 43:34.110
<b>Awaiting further orders.</b>

43:39.490 --> 43:42.370
<b>What in the world happened?</b>

43:59.800 --> 44:03.930
<b>This is armed scouting team seven.
No intel found on Elegian citizens.</b>

44:04.050 --> 44:07.430
<b>Armed scout team two, unable to
find any hostiles in the vicinity.</b>

44:07.560 --> 44:09.980
<b>This is armed scout team four with
a message for Vice Admiral Mononaga.</b>

44:10.100 --> 44:12.400
<b>The audience is still unconscious,
I repeat, still unconscious.</b>

44:12.520 --> 44:14.150
<b>They're not dead, are they?</b>

44:14.270 --> 44:15.860
<b>Just sleeping!</b>

44:16.270 --> 44:18.190
<b>But they're not waking up, no matter what.</b>

44:20.200 --> 44:25.080
<b>And if you kill me, nobody here
is going to get their soul back...</b>

44:25.200 --> 44:26.790
<b>You think that's a good idea?</b>

44:26.910 --> 44:28.410
<b>Miss.</b>

44:28.540 --> 44:33.920
<b>I believe I understand pretty well
how your Devil Fruit power works.</b>

44:34.040 --> 44:37.840
<b>Great, that saves me an explanation!
Go ahead and leave, then.</b>

44:37.960 --> 44:43.130
<b>Besides, it won't be long
until I'm gone, anyway.</b>

44:44.470 --> 44:47.720
<b>This scent... Is that a Wake-shroom?</b>

44:48.180 --> 44:49.720
<b>Wake-shroom?</b>

44:49.850 --> 44:55.480
<b>Those who eat them are unable to sleep,
and in time, they die.</b>

44:56.530 --> 45:00.150
<b>Woman! Do you want to take the entire
audience with you when you die?!</b>

45:00.400 --> 45:04.700
<b>What does death matter?
Isn't the soul more important than the body?</b>

45:04.820 --> 45:08.740
<b>In the new age, everyone is going
to be living together, in soul!</b>

45:10.200 --> 45:13.000
<b>I'd rather not shed any blood today.</b>

45:13.120 --> 45:18.090
<b>Is there any way you'll reconsider this plot
of yours to turn the world on its head?</b>

45:18.290 --> 45:19.630
<b>Huh? What even is that?</b>

45:19.880 --> 45:23.340
<b>I just want everyone to be happy!</b>

45:23.470 --> 45:27.640
<b>I can tell you're not one to listen to reason.</b>

45:27.760 --> 45:29.930
<b>And neither are you guys.</b>

45:30.060 --> 45:31.060
<b>Not so fast!</b>

45:32.980 --> 45:35.600
<b>With your singing voice blocked out,
your powers are nothing!</b>

45:35.730 --> 45:37.690
<b>Nice try. But you're too late.</b>

45:40.780 --> 45:44.740
<b>Captain Koby? What in the
world's gotten into you?</b>

45:47.280 --> 45:50.160
<b>Everyone! The bad guys are here!</b>

45:50.290 --> 45:53.410
<b>Let's beat them up together
for our new era!</b>

45:55.080 --> 45:59.710
<b>Don't hurt them! These are
innocent civilians she's controlling!</b>

46:06.510 --> 46:09.710
<b><i>I'm sick and tired of being alone
Wanna be connected</i></b>

46:09.720 --> 46:12.430
<b><i>Have a bond to hold on to</i></b>

46:12.620 --> 46:16.710
<b><i>Just gonna lay it all out, how I feel
Honest (Shout out!)</i></b>

46:19.350 --> 46:21.700
<b><i>Listen baby makin' you happy
Whether you like it or not</i></b>

46:21.710 --> 46:24.280
<b><i>Gonna be up in your ears
No run-in away just wait for the beat to drop</i></b>

46:24.400 --> 46:27.410
<b><i>Listen for a surprise
Every word will entice</i></b>

46:30.370 --> 46:33.750
<b><i>You think you're so tough?
Well I've had enough of it</i></b>

46:33.870 --> 46:35.710
<b><i>I got something here that's better</i></b>

46:35.830 --> 46:38.180
<b><i>Come on up and we can sing together</i></b>

46:38.220 --> 46:43.000
<b><i>Fun unfettered
Get on stage, let's go</i></b>

46:43.070 --> 46:46.420
<b><i>(Ha-how!) Wanna make your day
Do my thing loud and proud (Hey!)</i></b>

46:46.430 --> 46:48.550
<b><i>No shame in what I create
I got this down</i></b>

46:48.680 --> 46:53.810
<b><i>Everything exactly how we want it
This is a utopia</i></b>

46:54.100 --> 46:57.640
<b><i>Been a long time comin', now it's here to stay
You can't deny</i></b>

46:59.440 --> 47:02.520
<b><i>It's a miracle of mercy
You can't stop it if you try</i></b>

47:02.520 --> 47:05.940
<b><i>I know it's possible
I'm not tryin' ask too much</i></b>

47:06.070 --> 47:08.660
<b><i>Salvation's got to come
This generation's done</i></b>

47:08.720 --> 47:10.950
<b><i>It's tired of never being listened to</i></b>

47:11.530 --> 47:12.950
<b><i>The screams were never heard</i></b>

47:12.950 --> 47:15.830
<b><i>The suffering endured
But no more!</i></b>

47:16.000 --> 47:18.540
<b><i>Watch me rock this
They got nothin'</i></b>

47:18.670 --> 47:21.830
<b><i>Up to me, 
You just need to stay out of my way</i></b>

47:21.960 --> 47:26.550
<b><i>There's no turnin' back now
Gonna be singin' jointly for all time</i></b>

47:26.710 --> 47:29.300
<b><i>Blowin' your mind with my pace
Drummin' to burst your ear drum</i></b>

47:29.430 --> 47:33.320
<b><i>Bring in the bass, guitar and keys
Macaferri got nothin' on me, no</i></b>

47:33.320 --> 47:37.100
<b><i>Ooo-wah! Oh let me hear you shout!
Ooo-wah Ow-oo-wow</i></b>

47:37.230 --> 47:40.020
<b><i>Banish every gaslight
Let clarity shine</i></b>

47:40.050 --> 47:43.380
<b><i>Gotta clean up this brainwash
Don't let 'em tell you lies</i></b>

47:43.400 --> 47:45.610
<b><i>Heads up, let my song clear your senses</i></b>

47:45.630 --> 47:49.120
<b><i>All you really need
Is my true voice</i></b>

47:53.200 --> 47:55.870
<b>Dammit, it's no good! We're stuck.</b>

47:56.160 --> 47:58.120
<b>That was one pathetic display.</b>

47:58.250 --> 48:00.830
<b>You're just as stuck as I am, Moss Head!</b>

48:01.080 --> 48:03.590
<b>Franky, Jimbei, any luck?</b>

48:04.540 --> 48:05.880
<b>It won't budge at all!</b>

48:06.000 --> 48:07.760
<b>Likewise.</b>

48:07.880 --> 48:09.050
<b>Brook?</b>

48:09.170 --> 48:10.970
<b>I can almost...</b>

48:11.880 --> 48:13.010
<b>Are you almost free?</b>

48:13.260 --> 48:15.930
<b>I can almost see... Nami-san's panties.</b>

48:16.060 --> 48:16.850
<b>Say what?!</b>

48:16.990 --> 48:18.280
<b>You look, you die!</b>

48:19.810 --> 48:20.770
<b>Can I say something?</b>

48:21.310 --> 48:24.560
<b>Uta said she'd make us into a song, didn't she?</b>

48:24.690 --> 48:27.690
<b>Maybe we're arranged on a staff for a reason.</b>

48:27.820 --> 48:31.570
<b>It does appear to be some kind of melody...</b>

48:31.700 --> 48:34.240
<b>Maybe our heads are where the notes are?</b>

48:34.370 --> 48:36.700
<b>Can you sing it, Brook?</b>

48:36.830 --> 48:38.370
<b>I can't see the entire score...</b>

48:39.120 --> 48:41.160
<b>Right now I can most easily see...</b>

48:41.290 --> 48:43.830
<b>--some underwear.
--Shut up! And don't look!</b>

48:43.960 --> 48:47.590
<b>You noticed you were arranged on a score...
The Straw Hat crew never fails to impress.</b>

48:47.840 --> 48:48.670
<b>Huh?</b>

48:49.010 --> 48:51.170
<b>What are you two doing with Blueno?</b>

48:51.300 --> 48:52.720
<b>Explanations can wait for now.</b>

48:53.090 --> 48:55.090
<b>Here, sing this.</b>

48:55.850 --> 48:58.510
<b><i>Mi! Re!</i></b>

49:01.390 --> 49:02.480
<b>Finally free!</b>

49:03.690 --> 49:06.190
<b>Come on, keep it going, Brook!</b>

49:06.650 --> 49:10.030
<b>It seems you've got a grasp of the girl's power.</b>

49:10.150 --> 49:11.190
<b>Hey!</b>

49:11.780 --> 49:14.530
<b>Could you at least set my sister free?</b>

49:14.660 --> 49:16.280
<b>Big Brother...</b>

49:17.530 --> 49:20.750
<b>You cooperate with the Navy.
Even if it's temporary.</b>

49:23.210 --> 49:24.920
<b><i>Mi...</i></b>

49:25.040 --> 49:26.750
<b><i>Mi...</i></b>

49:26.880 --> 49:28.630
<b><i>Mi!</i></b>

49:28.750 --> 49:29.840
<b><i>Do re...</i></b>

49:29.960 --> 49:31.210
<b><i>Mi!</i></b>

49:32.630 --> 49:35.430
<b>Thank you. You are a magnificent little bear.</b>

49:35.930 --> 49:37.140
<b>Aye-aye!</b>

49:42.770 --> 49:45.560
<b>Why... are we still in here?!</b>

49:45.690 --> 49:51.110
<b>I can't let you loose until we know
for sure what Uta-sama's power are!</b>

49:51.440 --> 49:52.820
<b>Sunny!</b>

49:52.940 --> 49:54.110
<b>Sun... Sunny?</b>

49:55.920 --> 49:57.040
<b>Who're you?!</b>

49:57.700 --> 49:59.740
<b>It's good to see you again, Luffy-san.</b>

49:59.870 --> 50:04.330
<b>Koby! Get me... out of here!</b>

50:04.540 --> 50:06.370
<b>How'd you find us?</b>

50:06.500 --> 50:08.630
<b>I was able to sense Luffy-san's presence.</b>

50:08.750 --> 50:10.420
<b>Observation Haki, huh?</b>

50:10.550 --> 50:14.550
<b>After that, Blueno-san let us
use his Door-Door ability.</b>

50:14.760 --> 50:18.760
<b>Let me out with your Door-Door...</b>

50:19.970 --> 50:23.980
<b>Care to explain why Cipher Pol
and the Navy are working together?</b>

50:24.230 --> 50:27.980
<b>It's Uta's powers you really
want to know about, right?</b>

50:28.270 --> 50:30.570
<b>You know how they work?!</b>

50:32.070 --> 50:38.320
<b>This will be hard to believe,
but this world... It isn't reality.</b>

50:39.740 --> 50:41.870
<b>Everything you're seeing...</b>

50:41.990 --> 50:49.250
<b>...it's an imaginary world created in our
minds by Uta's Sing-Sing Fruit ability.</b>

50:49.750 --> 50:56.470
<b>The power of the Sing-Sing Fruit is to draw people's 
soul into this world after hearing the user sing.</b>

50:57.010 --> 51:00.970
<b>Those who are affected
feel like they're in a world</b>

51:01.100 --> 51:04.810
<b>where Uta makes the rules
instead of reality.</b>

51:05.100 --> 51:09.690
<b>It's like everyone is dreaming the same dream.</b>

51:10.520 --> 51:15.030
<b>Come to think of it, Uta mentioned
having a power like that.</b>

51:16.060 --> 51:20.660
<b>So that's why everybody would fall
asleep when listening to her sing!</b>

51:20.870 --> 51:23.740
<b>Would've been a big help
if you'd said something sooner!</b>

51:24.930 --> 51:26.030
<b>I forgot!</b>

51:26.120 --> 51:29.080
<b>So... what's going on in reality?</b>

51:29.210 --> 51:37.130
<b>Our bodies are still there,
but Uta has control over them.</b>

51:37.260 --> 51:39.090
<b>How do we get back to the real world?</b>

51:39.220 --> 51:42.470
<b>If Uta sleeps, her power will cease to function.</b>

51:42.600 --> 51:50.100
<b>But while we're in the world of the
Sing-Sing Fruit, we can't affect her in reality.</b>

51:50.350 --> 51:53.560
<b>If she's using a Devil Fruit power,
it has to have a limit.</b>

51:53.860 --> 51:55.320
<b>You're right.</b>

51:55.530 --> 51:59.700
<b>Maintaining the Sing-Sing world
is an incredible drain on her stamina.</b>

51:59.820 --> 52:03.740
<b>Sort of like how I can't constantly
use the Door-Door Fruit's power.</b>

52:03.950 --> 52:06.870
<b>So we'll be okay once Uta-sama 
gets tired enough to fall asleep?</b>

52:06.990 --> 52:08.250
<b>That's not likely.</b>

52:08.660 --> 52:12.750
<b>Before the concert started, she was confirmed
to be eating Wake-shrooms.</b>

52:13.000 --> 52:16.130
<b>They keep people who eat them from sleeping.</b>

52:16.670 --> 52:21.680
<b>It won't be long before Uta, in the real world,
runs out of strength... and dies.</b>

52:21.800 --> 52:23.930
<b>She's gonna die?</b>

52:24.550 --> 52:25.560
<b>Uta?</b>

52:25.680 --> 52:27.930
<b>Will we be released, then?</b>

52:28.140 --> 52:29.640
<b>No, the opposite.</b>

52:29.770 --> 52:36.230
<b>When Uta dies, this world
will be cut off from reality.</b>

52:36.360 --> 52:39.650
<b>And everyone in it...
us included, will be stuck here.</b>

52:40.320 --> 52:47.790
<b>Trapping all her fans in the Sing-Sing World...
That's what Uta has been planning.</b>

52:48.120 --> 52:50.450
<b>That's totally nuts!</b>

52:50.580 --> 52:53.460
<b>Koby, how do we stop Uta?</b>

52:53.750 --> 52:58.670
<b>That's what I came here to 
find out, but I'm still not sure.</b>

52:59.010 --> 53:01.420
<b>But the more fighting strength
we have, the better,</b>

53:01.550 --> 53:04.840
<b>so Helmeppo is gathering the pirates
who've been trapped here.</b>

53:04.970 --> 53:08.600
<b>The Straw Hat crew also appears
to be taking some action.</b>

53:08.720 --> 53:10.180
<b>Then they're okay!</b>

53:10.390 --> 53:12.980
<b>They were headed for the Elegia castle.</b>

53:13.270 --> 53:18.900
<b>Nico Robin seems to know something about
what happened on this island ages ago.</b>

53:19.030 --> 53:22.280
<b>If there're any records on what happened,</b>

53:22.400 --> 53:25.620
<b>it might help us learn how
to get around Uta's power.</b>

53:26.530 --> 53:28.330
<b>Not a lot to pin our hopes to...</b>

53:28.450 --> 53:30.540
<b>Have a little faith in Robin-chan,
you stupid Moss Head!</b>

53:30.660 --> 53:32.710
<b>It's just the facts, Twirly Brow!</b>

53:32.830 --> 53:35.750
<b>They said there's a room with
a bunch of books over there!</b>

53:40.710 --> 53:46.510
<b>Everyone, let's forget about those pirates
and wait for the dawn of the new era!</b>

53:50.260 --> 53:52.600
<b>How long until Uta dies in reality?</b>

53:52.730 --> 53:54.640
<b>Should be less than two hours left.</b>

54:01.530 --> 54:06.110
<b>With walls this soundproof, I doubt
Uta's powers can reach us here.</b>

54:06.240 --> 54:10.910
<b>The Navy boys mentioned that anywhere
beyond the sound of her voice would be safe.</b>

54:11.040 --> 54:13.660
<b>Are these all history books?</b>

54:13.790 --> 54:17.300
<b>How are we supposed to get through all of this?!</b>

54:25.090 --> 54:27.930
<b>Three-Sword Style! Ultra Tiger Hunt!</b>

54:31.560 --> 54:35.770
<b>Diable Jambe... Frites Assorties!</b>

54:36.850 --> 54:40.400
<b>Strong Right! Weapons Left!</b>

54:43.820 --> 54:45.150
<b>Robin, look through the books!</b>

54:45.400 --> 54:46.820
<b>--But--
--Robin!</b>

54:47.030 --> 54:49.660
<b>We'll keep them off you, don't worry!</b>

55:00.630 --> 55:05.340
<b>It won't be long before we're in
a new age... with no bad people.</b>

55:06.170 --> 55:09.890
<b>Do you read me?
Uta has an hour left, at most.</b>

55:10.140 --> 55:14.270
<b>But the Video Transponder Snails,
with their souls stolen, are out of control...</b>

55:14.560 --> 55:17.310
<b>They're continuing to broadcast footage
from the Sing-Sing World.</b>

55:17.640 --> 55:20.060
<b>They need to be muted to avoid trouble.</b>

55:20.190 --> 55:24.070
<b>The second someone hears her singing,
their soul will be captured.</b>

55:25.070 --> 55:27.280
<b><i>Listen baby makin' you happy
Whether you like it or not</i></b>

55:27.400 --> 55:29.990
<b><i>Gonna be up in your ears
No run-in' away just wait for the beat to drop</i></b>

55:30.110 --> 55:33.030
<b><i>Listen for a surprise
Every word will entice</i></b>

55:36.080 --> 55:39.670
<b><i>You think you're so tough?
Well, I've had enough of it</i></b>

55:39.670 --> 55:41.380
<b><i>I got something here that's better</i></b>

55:41.500 --> 55:44.070
<b><i>Come on up and we can sing together</i></b>

55:44.080 --> 55:49.390
<b><i>Fun unfettered
Get on stage, let's go (Ha-how!)</i></b>

55:49.430 --> 55:52.850
<b>It's been six hours since Uta began her concert.</b>

55:52.970 --> 55:55.720
<b>The number of victims has been
increasing at an exponential rate.</b>

55:55.890 --> 55:58.600
<b>If things proceed at this rate, in one hour,</b>

55:58.930 --> 56:03.020
<b>the estimate is that 70% of the world's 
population will be pulled into the Sing-Sing World.</b>

56:03.310 --> 56:05.320
<b>Seventy percent?
That's worse than we anticipated.</b>

56:05.440 --> 56:07.900
<b>This could mean the end of the world.</b>

56:08.110 --> 56:10.530
<b>She needs to be stopped somehow.</b>

56:12.660 --> 56:14.080
<b>Nice!</b>

56:15.830 --> 56:17.370
<b>Very nice-eh!</b>

56:17.500 --> 56:21.540
<b>You're coming home with me
to sing me a lullaby-eh!</b>

56:23.880 --> 56:25.040
<b>A Celestial Dragon...</b>

56:27.550 --> 56:30.090
<b>Saint Charloss is requesting your presence.</b>

56:30.220 --> 56:31.630
<b>You should be grateful.</b>

56:31.880 --> 56:34.640
<b>I'll pay a billion for you-eh!</b>

56:35.390 --> 56:38.350
<b>Wait, are you one of those Celestial Dragons?</b>

56:41.310 --> 56:43.230
<b>I know about them! It was in a book.</b>

56:43.350 --> 56:46.930
<b>They rule the world and want
to make slaves out of everyone.</b>

56:46.920 --> 56:48.930
<b>They're the most hated people in the world!</b>

56:50.400 --> 56:53.410
<b>You need to cut it out before you upset him.</b>

56:53.530 --> 56:55.320
<b>You guys are Marines?</b>

56:55.450 --> 56:58.540
<b>You must've taken leave to
come and see me! Thanks!</b>

56:58.660 --> 57:02.410
<b>Never mind that. You will obey Saint Charloss
and accompany us to the Holy Land.</b>

57:02.540 --> 57:03.140
<b>No way.</b>

57:04.000 --> 57:05.670
<b>Everyone's equal here!</b>

57:05.960 --> 57:09.300
<b>And we're glad to have this
old Celestial Dragon join us!</b>

57:09.420 --> 57:12.800
<b>Old?! She gets an execution-eh!</b>

57:15.340 --> 57:18.100
<b>Seriously, there's no point.</b>

57:22.810 --> 57:26.060
<b>If you're useless, I don't need you-eh.</b>

57:27.040 --> 57:28.570
<b>How could you do that?!</b>

57:28.900 --> 57:31.400
<b>It's okay. I'll save you.</b>

57:33.820 --> 57:36.240
<b>What are you Marines doing-eh?!</b>

57:36.370 --> 57:38.910
<b>Kill this little wench-eh!</b>

57:41.080 --> 57:45.250
<b>I thought the Navy was supposed
to represent justice...</b>

57:47.960 --> 57:51.300
<b>The Celestial Dragons might as well be gods...</b>

57:51.710 --> 57:55.630
<b>I get it! You don't really want to follow
this jerk's orders, do you?</b>

57:55.970 --> 57:57.300
<b>In that case, don't worry about it!</b>

57:57.430 --> 58:01.930
<b>In the new era, Celestial Dragons
and slaves will all be equal!</b>

58:02.100 --> 58:04.600
<b>Equality?! How revolting!</b>

58:04.730 --> 58:07.810
<b>All of you, hurry and kill her-eh!</b>

58:08.020 --> 58:09.570
<b>It's not personal, girl...</b>

58:15.530 --> 58:17.320
<b>Huh?</b>

58:19.280 --> 58:22.330
<b>Don't... think... you'll get...
away with tharrgble!</b>

58:31.050 --> 58:35.050
<b>You guys don't have to be afraid
of the Celestial Dragons anymore!</b>

58:38.510 --> 58:41.180
<b>This... This isn't a good idea, Uta!</b>

58:41.430 --> 58:43.020
<b>If you mess with a Celestial Dragon...</b>

58:43.140 --> 58:45.810
<b>...the World Government and Navy
will hunt you down!</b>

58:45.940 --> 58:47.060
<b>I'm telling you, it's fine!</b>

58:47.190 --> 58:48.940
<b>Sorry, Uta!</b>

58:49.440 --> 58:54.990
<b>I should be heading home by now.
I've got sheep to look after.</b>

58:55.150 --> 58:57.240
<b>Thanks! I had a great time!</b>

58:57.360 --> 58:59.870
<b>Hang on... I don't understand...</b>

59:01.030 --> 59:04.040
<b>Why would you want to go back
to a life that's so hard and painful</b>

59:04.160 --> 59:06.580
<b>when you could enjoy life here instead?</b>

59:06.710 --> 59:10.500
<b>Most importantly, anyone know what happened
to the pirates I had captured before?</b>

59:13.420 --> 59:16.590
<b>Uta-san, this needs to stop now!</b>

59:17.010 --> 59:20.140
<b>You're a Marine, too?
You here to save the Celestial Dragon?</b>

59:20.340 --> 59:23.010
<b>I'm here to save lives!</b>

59:23.470 --> 59:28.060
<b>You need to release everyone's souls
so they can return to reality.</b>

59:28.190 --> 59:29.350
<b>Captain Koby?!</b>

59:35.250 --> 59:36.510
<b>Is he famous or something?</b>

59:36.570 --> 59:40.780
<b>He's the hero who saved people
during the Rocky Port incident!</b>

59:41.780 --> 59:47.620
<b>Really? I've been on Elegia all this time,
so I haven't kept up with the news.</b>

59:47.960 --> 59:49.250
<b>W-Well...</b>

59:49.370 --> 59:51.000
<b>Hey, hero.</b>

59:51.500 --> 59:55.090
<b>I've used my power too much.
You have to tell them.</b>

59:55.380 --> 59:56.300
<b>Right.</b>

59:56.920 --> 59:59.170
<b>Everyone, please listen!</b>

59:59.300 --> 01:00:03.350
<b>The truth is, this world that
we're in is not reality.</b>

01:00:10.020 --> 01:00:12.730
<b>You've all been lied to!
</b>

01:00:12.940 --> 01:00:16.030
<b>We should leave this place as soon as possible!</b>

01:00:17.400 --> 01:00:20.650
<b>Uta... did you really...
lie to us and trap us here?!</b>

01:00:20.860 --> 01:00:24.330
<b>It's not a lie!
I haven't lied to anybody!</b>

01:00:24.450 --> 01:00:29.160
<b>You've got it all wrong, guys!
I'm just trying to lead you to happiness!</b>

01:00:33.080 --> 01:00:35.590
<b>This is the place you've all dreamed of.</b>

01:00:35.710 --> 01:00:37.920
<b>The Great Pirate Era is over!</b>

01:00:38.050 --> 01:00:40.590
<b>It's going to be an age of freedom
and peace instead!</b>

01:00:42.510 --> 01:00:43.930
<b>Isn't that fantastic?!</b>

01:00:44.050 --> 01:00:46.100
<b>There'll be plenty of food and games!</b>

01:00:46.220 --> 01:00:50.560
<b>There'll be no mean people,
no sickness, no pain!</b>

01:00:50.680 --> 01:00:53.560
<b>Yeah... I guess it would be happier living here.</b>

01:00:53.690 --> 01:00:54.520
<b>Me, too!</b>

01:00:54.730 --> 01:00:56.190
<b>Right?! I knew it!</b>

01:00:56.360 --> 01:00:58.150
<b>But... I've got work...</b>

01:00:58.280 --> 01:01:02.570
<b>I'm trying to tell you, you don't
have to work! Or study...</b>

01:01:02.700 --> 01:01:04.990
<b>But still... I don't want to stay here forever.</b>

01:01:05.200 --> 01:01:06.910
<b>There're things I've put a lot of work into.</b>

01:01:07.030 --> 01:01:08.870
<b>And the idea of playing around all the time...</b>

01:01:08.990 --> 01:01:10.370
<b>I wanna go home.</b>

01:01:10.500 --> 01:01:12.290
<b>This would completely
change civilization, right?</b>

01:01:12.410 --> 01:01:13.790
<b>I don't think I can go along with this...</b>

01:01:13.920 --> 01:01:16.000
<b>Even if it is Uta's idea...</b>

01:01:16.290 --> 01:01:18.840
<b>Uta-san, you should cancel your--</b>

01:01:18.960 --> 01:01:20.130
<b>Hang on a second!</b>

01:01:20.260 --> 01:01:23.630
<b>Everyone! I thought you wanted to be free!</b>

01:01:23.970 --> 01:01:27.470
<b>Were you lying when you said you wanted
no more diseases or bullying?!</b>

01:01:27.720 --> 01:01:31.270
<b>You told me you didn't want to spend
every day afraid of pirates!</b>

01:01:31.390 --> 01:01:33.100
<b>I'm telling you, I want to go home, dammit!</b>

01:01:35.230 --> 01:01:38.360
<b>Stop that! Uta has done
all of this for our sake!</b>

01:01:38.360 --> 01:01:40.150
<b>I never asked her to!</b>

01:01:40.400 --> 01:01:41.000
<b>Same here!</b>

01:01:41.010 --> 01:01:42.150
<b>You guys need to shut up!</b>

01:01:42.190 --> 01:01:43.460
<b>I agree with Uta!</b>

01:01:43.490 --> 01:01:44.440
<b>I don't like this.</b>

01:01:44.480 --> 01:01:45.750
<b>I liked going to school!</b>

01:01:45.750 --> 01:01:47.220
<b>What difference does tha t make?</b>

01:01:47.320 --> 01:01:48.630
<b>A big one!</b>

01:01:48.640 --> 01:01:50.240
<b>Uta's goin g too far!</b>

01:01:50.370 --> 01:01:51.090
<b>You're awful!</b>

01:01:51.890 --> 01:01:53.100
<b>What did you just say to me?!</b>

01:01:53.250 --> 01:01:56.250
<b>Okay! Sorry, I get it now!</b>

01:01:57.710 --> 01:02:00.420
<b>You just need to have more fun, right?!</b>

01:02:08.260 --> 01:02:11.930
<b>See? You're all having fun now, right?!</b>

01:02:20.520 --> 01:02:26.820
<b>Everyone! Let's all enjoy a free and
peaceful new age together, forever!</b>

01:02:30.120 --> 01:02:31.240
<b>Saint Charloss!</b>

01:02:31.370 --> 01:02:34.910
<b>We can't afford more casualties.
The time has come to make a decision.</b>

01:02:35.210 --> 01:02:38.880
<b>Even if a Celestial Dragon
is caught in the crossfire...</b>

01:02:47.970 --> 01:02:49.850
<b>Well, we barely made it out of there.</b>

01:02:49.970 --> 01:02:51.850
<b>Who the heck are you?!</b>

01:02:51.970 --> 01:02:53.140
<b>Blueno.</b>

01:02:53.270 --> 01:02:55.060
<b>Koby, did you see Uta?</b>

01:02:55.180 --> 01:02:56.140
<b>Well...</b>

01:02:56.270 --> 01:02:58.400
<b>I'm guessing negotiations have fallen through.</b>

01:02:58.520 --> 01:02:59.420
<b>How about you guys?</b>

01:02:59.420 --> 01:03:00.400
<b>Check it out!</b>

01:03:02.020 --> 01:03:05.240
<b>Hold on! I didn't hear anything
about working with Straw Hat!</b>

01:03:05.360 --> 01:03:06.650
<b>I'd rather die!</b>

01:03:06.780 --> 01:03:07.650
<b>See ya!</b>

01:03:08.660 --> 01:03:09.490
<b>Wait a minute--</b>

01:03:09.740 --> 01:03:12.530
<b>We'll figure out our own way of beating Uta!</b>

01:03:12.830 --> 01:03:14.080
<b>Sunny...</b>

01:03:14.410 --> 01:03:15.580
<b>What about my crew?</b>

01:03:15.700 --> 01:03:17.370
<b>Still not back.</b>

01:03:17.500 --> 01:03:21.000
<b>If they can't find Uta's weakness,
we're out of options.</b>

01:03:22.130 --> 01:03:24.760
<b>And I can't use my Door-Door
ability in this body...</b>

01:03:25.010 --> 01:03:27.510
<b>It'll be fine. Knowing my gang...</b>

01:03:27.930 --> 01:03:30.390
<b>Rolling... Exploding Star!</b>

01:03:32.010 --> 01:03:33.180
<b>How's that?!</b>

01:03:33.390 --> 01:03:38.480
<b>"The fears and doubts of men...
given the name Tot Musica.</b>

01:03:38.770 --> 01:03:40.940
<b>Now flee and cower."</b>

01:03:41.150 --> 01:03:43.070
<b>Kung Fu Point!</b>

01:03:43.360 --> 01:03:45.190
<b>Mirage Tempo!</b>

01:03:50.990 --> 01:03:52.490
<b>Diable Jambe!</b>

01:03:53.030 --> 01:03:55.160
<b>Collier Strike!</b>

01:03:55.290 --> 01:03:57.080
<b>One-Sword Style... Demon Horse!</b>

01:04:01.040 --> 01:04:05.210
<b>Soul Parade... Ice Burn!</b>

01:04:07.420 --> 01:04:10.220
<b>Fishman Karate! Sharkskin Palm Thrust!</b>

01:04:11.090 --> 01:04:14.350
<b>Radical Beam! Giant Slalom!</b>

01:04:16.720 --> 01:04:18.520
<b>Uh-oh! It's gonna collapse!</b>

01:04:18.640 --> 01:04:21.190
<b>What idiot started blowing stuff up indoors?!</b>

01:04:21.770 --> 01:04:23.810
<b>Super sorry about that!</b>

01:04:27.530 --> 01:04:31.030
<b>We'll be buried alive!
Come to think of it, I'd look right at home!</b>

01:04:31.150 --> 01:04:33.280
<b>This way, Robin!</b>

01:04:36.330 --> 01:04:40.500
<b>Brulee! I know you're in there!
Let us into Mirro-world right now!</b>

01:04:43.110 --> 01:04:44.460
<b>Quit ignoring me!</b>

01:04:44.590 --> 01:04:48.630
<b>You realize without our intel, you'll be stuck
in the Sing-Sing World, too, right?!</b>

01:04:48.760 --> 01:04:51.240
<b>You'll never see your precious
friends and family again.</b>

01:04:51.260 --> 01:04:52.130
<b>You okay with that?!</b>

01:04:53.720 --> 01:04:55.760
<b>Not even Big Bro Katakuri...?</b>

01:04:55.890 --> 01:04:57.010
<b>N-No!</b>

01:05:11.860 --> 01:05:13.660
<b>You guys! You made it!</b>

01:05:13.780 --> 01:05:14.620
<b>Luffy!</b>

01:05:14.740 --> 01:05:15.570
<b>Sunny!</b>

01:05:17.330 --> 01:05:18.450
<b>Who's that supposed to be?</b>

01:05:18.660 --> 01:05:19.830
<b>It's Sunny!</b>

01:05:20.980 --> 01:05:21.910
<b>She's so cute!</b>

01:05:22.040 --> 01:05:23.920
<b>What kind of mods did that?!</b>

01:05:25.240 --> 01:05:27.210
<b>Can't believe we ended up back here...</b>

01:05:27.340 --> 01:05:29.380
<b>Sorry, Big Bro Oven.</b>

01:05:29.630 --> 01:05:33.220
<b>Robin-san, did you discover how to beat Uta?</b>

01:05:33.430 --> 01:05:37.430
<b>The old records say that those
trapped in the Sing-Sing World</b>

01:05:37.550 --> 01:05:41.310
<b>won't be able to return to reality
under their own power. No matter what.</b>

01:05:43.100 --> 01:05:48.570
<b>But if someone with the Sing-Sing Fruit powers
uses Tot Musica, there'll be a chance.</b>

01:05:48.690 --> 01:05:50.530
<b>Tot Musica?</b>

01:05:50.860 --> 01:05:54.240
<b>An entity from ancient times
created from human emotions.</b>

01:05:54.700 --> 01:05:57.870
<b>Loneliness, sadness...
the shadows that fall on the soul.</b>

01:05:57.990 --> 01:05:59.490
<b>It's been called a Demon King before as well.</b>

01:05:59.620 --> 01:06:01.910
<b>Is it some kind of weapon?</b>

01:06:02.040 --> 01:06:04.960
<b>The part I was able to read
only mentioned avoiding it.</b>

01:06:06.460 --> 01:06:10.960
<b>So if the Sing-Sing Fruit user breaks this
taboo, what kind of chance will we get?</b>

01:06:11.170 --> 01:06:15.340
<b>The records say that when the Demon King
is summoned with Tot Musica,</b>

01:06:15.470 --> 01:06:21.850
<b>it'll appear both in the world created by 
the Sing-Sing Fruit as well as in reality.</b>

01:06:21.970 --> 01:06:27.600
<b>The Demon King acts as a link between
the two worlds at that point.</b>

01:06:27.730 --> 01:06:32.190
<b>And if the Demon King is attacked 
in both worlds at the same time...</b>

01:06:32.320 --> 01:06:35.990
<b>...he'll be defeated, and that
will erase the song world.</b>

01:06:36.200 --> 01:06:37.240
<b>Really?!</b>

01:06:37.360 --> 01:06:40.950
<b>I doubt there'd be a record
unless it worked before.</b>

01:06:41.080 --> 01:06:43.120
<b>We've gotta try it!</b>

01:06:47.640 --> 01:06:51.290
<b>Who's gonna attack Uta-sama in reality, though?</b>

01:06:51.500 --> 01:06:55.220
<b>Well, we're all stuck in here...</b>

01:06:55.340 --> 01:06:58.260
<b>The only people who could strike in
reality would be the Navy or Cipher--</b>

01:06:58.390 --> 01:06:59.470
<b>No.</b>

01:06:59.760 --> 01:07:02.390
<b>They won't make a move
with civilian lives at stake.</b>

01:07:02.510 --> 01:07:06.020
<b>As valuable as this intel is,
without someone to work within reality...</b>

01:07:06.140 --> 01:07:07.770
<b>There is someone.</b>

01:07:09.690 --> 01:07:10.980
<b>Captain!</b>

01:07:13.150 --> 01:07:14.610
<b>Is that Bepo? Seriously?</b>

01:07:14.740 --> 01:07:16.700
<b>And who's the old guy?</b>

01:07:16.820 --> 01:07:19.360
<b>That's Uta-sama's adoptive father, Gordon-san!</b>

01:07:20.410 --> 01:07:21.330
<b>Uta-chan's dad?</b>

01:07:21.370 --> 01:07:23.950
<b>So who exactly are you talking about?</b>

01:07:24.080 --> 01:07:25.190
<b>Shanks...</b>

01:07:25.950 --> 01:07:27.210
<b>Shanks?!</b>

01:07:27.330 --> 01:07:32.040
<b>When Shanks arrives,
he'll be able to stop Uta in reality.</b>

01:07:32.340 --> 01:07:35.420
<b>Old guy, did something happen
between Uta and Shanks?</b>

01:07:35.760 --> 01:07:37.170
<b>Well...</b>

01:07:39.380 --> 01:07:40.550
<b>Old guy!</b>

01:07:43.890 --> 01:07:49.020
<b>Ah! He's going straight to Uta-sama!
And we can't beat her yet!</b>

01:07:49.140 --> 01:07:51.650
<b>There's no stopping our captain
when he gets like that.</b>

01:07:51.770 --> 01:07:55.360
<b>We're running out of time anyway.
Might as well join him and put an end to this.</b>

01:07:55.690 --> 01:07:56.990
<b>But how?</b>

01:07:57.110 --> 01:08:01.320
<b>If we need simultaneous attacks,
we'll start hitting her and won't stop...</b>

01:08:01.780 --> 01:08:06.200
<b>...until the attack on the other side starts
and the timing matches up.</b>

01:08:06.330 --> 01:08:09.000
<b>I feel like a punk for chickening out!</b>

01:08:09.120 --> 01:08:12.710
<b>There's no way we can lose
with the Straw Hats backing us!</b>

01:08:13.080 --> 01:08:14.880
<b>We've got no other choice.</b>

01:08:15.000 --> 01:08:15.920
<b>Yeah!</b>

01:08:16.460 --> 01:08:19.300
<b>So... I was wondering...
What happened to you?</b>

01:08:19.420 --> 01:08:20.590
<b>Now you ask?</b>

01:08:37.230 --> 01:08:38.460
<b>What are you doing here?</b>

01:08:38.820 --> 01:08:41.230
<b>You can fight me over and over, 
but you'll never win.</b>

01:08:41.990 --> 01:08:43.820
<b>It's not over yet.</b>

01:08:43.950 --> 01:08:46.200
<b>There you go again, you sore loser!</b>

01:08:50.040 --> 01:08:54.290
<b>Then, I guess we'll settle this with
a fight, like we used to, Luffy.</b>

01:09:17.190 --> 01:09:18.610
<b>You're not even trying to hit me.</b>

01:09:24.240 --> 01:09:25.700
<b>What you're doing is wrong!</b>

01:09:25.820 --> 01:09:27.580
<b>I could say that to you, Luffy.</b>

01:09:28.540 --> 01:09:32.790
<b>You need to realize that
the Great Pirate Era is over.</b>

01:09:33.830 --> 01:09:37.000
<b>Why do you wanna be the King
of the Pirates so bad, anyway?</b>

01:09:37.210 --> 01:09:38.880
<b>To make a new era.</b>

01:09:40.790 --> 01:09:41.800
<b>Luffy--!</b>

01:09:47.680 --> 01:09:50.560
<b>The Great Pirate Era began
with Roger's execution...</b>

01:09:52.140 --> 01:09:56.100
<b>Now, Luffy, it's gonna end with yours!</b>

01:09:56.230 --> 01:09:57.310
<b>Don't do it!</b>

01:09:59.270 --> 01:10:01.360
<b>Uta!</b>

01:10:02.190 --> 01:10:08.170
<b>You... You used to love the
Red-Haired Pirates so much!</b>

01:10:09.340 --> 01:10:12.160
<b>You used to love Shanks so much!</b>

01:10:12.450 --> 01:10:15.170
<b>Why do you hate pirates now?!</b>

01:10:17.580 --> 01:10:19.170
<b>It's Shanks' fault.</b>

01:10:20.500 --> 01:10:23.130
<b>I thought of him...</b>

01:10:25.380 --> 01:10:27.510
<b>...like my own father!</b>

01:10:35.020 --> 01:10:40.020
<b>I considered everyone on that ship to be family!</b>

01:10:40.190 --> 01:10:43.900
<b>But that was just a lie they told me!</b>

01:10:44.240 --> 01:10:47.490
<b>That's why... Shanks abandonded me!</b>

01:10:47.990 --> 01:10:51.450
<b>He left me behind on Elegia!</b>

01:10:51.580 --> 01:10:54.660
<b>He said it was so you could be a singer!</b>

01:10:54.790 --> 01:10:55.710
<b>Wrong!</b>

01:11:03.840 --> 01:11:09.050
<b>Magnificent! Your voice is a gift to the world!</b>

01:11:09.220 --> 01:11:13.470
<b>There's no shortage of experts,
instruments, and music here.</b>

01:11:13.970 --> 01:11:16.810
<b>We would love for you to join us in Elegia!</b>

01:11:16.940 --> 01:11:19.060
<b>The entire country would welcome you!</b>

01:11:20.900 --> 01:11:24.480
<b>You seemed to really enjoy singing back there.</b>

01:11:24.610 --> 01:11:26.150
<b>Hm? I guess...</b>

01:11:26.280 --> 01:11:31.910
<b>You sure you wouldn't rather sing
for a big crowd instead of for us?</b>

01:11:32.030 --> 01:11:33.660
<b>It's not like that.</b>

01:11:34.370 --> 01:11:35.540
<b>Y'know, Uta...</b>

01:11:35.660 --> 01:11:39.290
<b>Things like peace and equality
don't really exist in the world.</b>

01:11:40.420 --> 01:11:42.590
<b>But your voice...</b>

01:11:42.710 --> 01:11:46.260
<b>It's the one thing that can bring happiness
to everyone in the world.</b>

01:11:46.380 --> 01:11:47.420
<b>What are you talking about?</b>

01:11:47.670 --> 01:11:50.010
<b>You can stay, if you want.</b>

01:11:50.430 --> 01:11:52.930
<b>I'll come pick you up once you're
the greatest singer in the world.</b>

01:11:53.140 --> 01:11:56.520
<b>Stupid! I'm the Red-Haired Pirates' musician!</b>

01:11:56.640 --> 01:12:00.810
<b>If you're asking me to choose between learning
about music and leaving... leaving you guys...</b>

01:12:00.940 --> 01:12:02.500
<b>Okay, I get it!</b>

01:12:02.810 --> 01:12:05.900
<b>You've got a point. We can ship out tomorrow.</b>

01:12:08.030 --> 01:12:10.160
<b>But that night...<i></i></b>

01:12:17.370 --> 01:12:18.620
<b>Gordon-san?</b>

01:12:20.170 --> 01:12:21.710
<b>You're awake?</b>

01:12:25.340 --> 01:12:26.920
<b>What happened?</b>

01:12:27.050 --> 01:12:28.630
<b>Where are Shanks and the others?!</b>

01:12:28.760 --> 01:12:30.760
<b>They took everything!</b>

01:12:32.390 --> 01:12:35.560
<b>Everyone... they're all dead...</b>

01:12:35.680 --> 01:12:36.850
<b>Where is Shanks?!</b>

01:12:37.060 --> 01:12:44.020
<b>They used your singing voice to approach Elegia,
plotting to make off with our treasures...</b>

01:12:44.150 --> 01:12:45.360
<b>You mean...?</b>

01:12:45.480 --> 01:12:47.610
<b>The Red-Haired Pirates...</b>

01:12:51.150 --> 01:12:56.990
<b>They've been lying to you this whole time!
The Red-Haired Pirates! And Shanks!</b>

01:13:04.540 --> 01:13:07.880
<b>Shanks! Don't leave me!</b>

01:13:20.390 --> 01:13:23.850
<b>Why...? Why would you do this?!</b>

01:13:30.630 --> 01:13:34.130
<b>The country of music, Elegia, destroyed</b>

01:13:33.550 --> 01:13:37.550
<b>Love and peace are trampled with only two survivors!</b>

01:13:37.050 --> 01:13:41.020
<b>The Culprit is Red-Haired Shanks</b>

01:13:41.020 --> 01:13:43.020
<b></b>

01:13:43.500 --> 01:13:47.290
<b>Shanks would never do something like that!
And you know that!</b>

01:13:47.500 --> 01:13:49.880
<b>Then explain the last 12 years!</b>

01:13:50.000 --> 01:13:54.340
<b>You're nothing but a tool
for Shanks, too, Luffy!</b>

01:13:54.470 --> 01:13:55.550
<b>Shanks is coming.</b>

01:13:55.800 --> 01:13:57.300
<b>To save you?</b>

01:13:57.430 --> 01:13:59.100
<b>To save you.</b>

01:13:59.220 --> 01:14:00.680
<b>Me? Why?</b>

01:14:00.890 --> 01:14:05.690
<b>You think he's gonna sit back while his
daughter pulls something like this?!</b>

01:14:11.030 --> 01:14:13.060
<b>He abandoned me...</b>

01:14:14.140 --> 01:14:15.100
<b>He's not coming.</b>

01:14:23.000 --> 01:14:25.330
<b>Enough is enough, Luffy.</b>

01:14:27.290 --> 01:14:28.290
<b>Bye-bye.</b>

01:14:39.140 --> 01:14:40.510
<b>Shanks...?</b>

01:14:42.560 --> 01:14:43.640
<b>Why?</b>

01:14:45.350 --> 01:14:47.730
<b>It's been a while...</b>

01:14:48.440 --> 01:14:49.980
<b>And I felt like hearing you sing.</b>

01:15:07.330 --> 01:15:09.080
<b>This is perfect!</b>

01:15:09.210 --> 01:15:13.130
<b>Soon, all my fans and I are
going to bring a new age.</b>

01:15:13.250 --> 01:15:17.380
<b>And I wanted to settle up
with you before I did!</b>

01:15:19.590 --> 01:15:23.430
<b>Everyone! The worst pirate of all is here!</b>

01:15:23.810 --> 01:15:25.230
<b>Let's beat him together!</b>

01:15:29.400 --> 01:15:30.860
<b>Shanks is here, isn't he?</b>

01:15:32.270 --> 01:15:33.270
<b>Now!</b>

01:15:49.590 --> 01:15:51.750
<b>You still want to fight? In that case...</b>

01:15:53.290 --> 01:15:55.340
<b><i>--We can choose the way of our future</i></b>

01:15:55.340 --> 01:15:56.460
<b>--Hold it right there!<i>
--We can choose the way of our future</i></b>

01:15:56.460 --> 01:15:57.510
<b>--We can choose the way of our future</b>

01:15:57.510 --> 01:15:58.010
<b>--Sunny! Sunny--!
--<i>Try a brand new path</i></b>

01:15:58.010 --> 01:15:59.840
<b>--Sunny! Sunny--!
--<i>Try a brand new path</i></b>

01:16:02.800 --> 01:16:04.640
<b>Guard Point!</b>

01:16:04.760 --> 01:16:06.640
<b>Room! Shambles!</b>

01:16:07.680 --> 01:16:10.230
<b>Barrier Ball! Sound!</b>

01:16:13.060 --> 01:16:17.150
<b>Uta-sama, that voice of yours
is trapped in here now!</b>

01:16:20.780 --> 01:16:21.780
<b>Whoa, there.</b>

01:16:34.290 --> 01:16:36.880
<b>Stow it, Gab!
You die before you fight back!</b>

01:16:43.530 --> 01:16:44.730
<b>No! No!</b>

01:16:48.180 --> 01:16:50.850
<b>Just hang on! The new age is almost here!</b>

01:16:58.610 --> 01:17:03.700
<b>That's right. Deploy every last asset
the Navy has to eliminate Uta.</b>

01:17:04.120 --> 01:17:06.330
<b>Doesn't matter if the audience go with her!</b>

01:17:06.450 --> 01:17:10.500
<b>We're doing this to protect the world
before she threatens anyone else!</b>

01:17:10.790 --> 01:17:12.000
<b>Annihilate her!</b>

01:17:12.500 --> 01:17:16.040
<b>So, the self-righteous Navy is willing
to kill a bunch of civilians?</b>

01:17:16.340 --> 01:17:17.420
<b>Is that it, Kizaru?!</b>

01:17:17.670 --> 01:17:21.760
<b>No such thing as justice without sacrifices.</b>

01:17:21.880 --> 01:17:28.350
<b>Ain't it a shame, having to sacrifice
thousands to kill one kid?</b>

01:17:29.560 --> 01:17:32.060
<b>Yasakani Sacred Jewel!</b>

01:17:43.740 --> 01:17:47.120
<b>Sorry, but this is kind of a family quarrel.</b>

01:17:49.200 --> 01:17:51.410
<b>Mind keeping out of it?</b>

01:17:55.540 --> 01:18:00.710
<b>I'm afraid that's not an option.
Not with the world on the line.</b>

01:18:02.720 --> 01:18:05.010
<b>I'm asking you to back off anyway.</b>

01:18:07.720 --> 01:18:12.270
<b>If I could do that sort of thing...
I'd still have my sight.</b>

01:18:16.060 --> 01:18:17.610
<b>Hongo-san...</b>

01:18:18.690 --> 01:18:22.280
<b>It looks like something's happening in reality.</b>

01:18:27.620 --> 01:18:29.780
<b>She's definitely been eating Wake-shrooms.</b>

01:18:30.870 --> 01:18:33.370
<b>They don't just keep people from sleeping,</b>

01:18:33.580 --> 01:18:37.000
<b>they make you turn aggressive
and lose control of your emotions.</b>

01:18:47.550 --> 01:18:52.600
<b>Bad guys need to look like bad guys.
I should've done this sooner.</b>

01:18:54.720 --> 01:18:56.260
<b>Uta!</b>

01:19:00.570 --> 01:19:03.780
<b>I wasn't brave enough...</b>

01:19:03.900 --> 01:19:06.030
<b>I didn't have the courage to use it!</b>

01:19:06.450 --> 01:19:09.160
<b>But I'm done being afraid!</b>

01:19:11.370 --> 01:19:13.080
<b>Be careful. I'm pretty sure that's--</b>

01:19:13.200 --> 01:19:15.830
<b>--<i>ᚷᚨᚺ ᛉᚨᚾ ᛏᚨᚲ ᚷᚨᚺ ᛉᚨᚾ ᛏᚨᛏ ᛏᚨᛏ ᛒᚱᚨᚲ</i></b>

01:19:15.830 --> 01:19:18.370
<b>--My perfect barrier...!
--<i>ᚷᚨᚺ ᛉᚨᚾ ᛏᚨᚲ ᚷᚨᚺ ᛉᚨᚾ ᛏᚨᛏ ᛏᚨᛏ ᛒᚱᚨᚲ
</i></b>

01:19:18.370 --> 01:19:23.810
<b>--<i>ᚷᚨᚺ ᛉᚨᚾ ᛏᚨᚲ ᚷᚨᚺ ᛉᚨᚾ ᛏᚨᛏ ᛏᚨᛏ ᛒᚱᚨᚲ</i></b>

01:19:23.810 --> 01:19:24.760
<b>--That's...
--<i>ᚷᚨᚺ ᛉᚨᚾ ᛏᚨᚲ ᚷᚨᚺ ᛉᚨᚾ ᛏᚨᛏ ᛏᚨᛏ ᛒᚱᚨᚲ</i></b>

01:19:24.760 --> 01:19:26.590
<b>--Well, this is bad.
--<i>ᚷᚨᚺ ᛉᚨᚾ ᛏᚨᚲ ᚷᚨᚺ ᛉᚨᚾ ᛏᚨᛏ ᛏᚨᛏ ᛒᚱᚨᚲ</i></b>

01:19:26.880 --> 01:19:28.930
<b>--We went to the trouble of preparing these,</b>

01:19:28.930 --> 01:19:29.530
<b>--We went to the trouble of preparing these,
--<i>Wand'ring heart
Clouds above</i></b>

01:19:29.520 --> 01:19:32.350
<b>--but now there's no point.
--<i>Wand'ring heart
Clouds above</i></b>

01:19:32.470 --> 01:19:35.430
<b><i>Rain begins to fall down</i></b>

01:19:35.560 --> 01:19:37.770
<b>--<i>My bitter tears flowing out
They never dry up</i></b>

01:19:37.770 --> 01:19:39.300
<b>--This can't get much worse!
She's awoken it!
--<i>My bitter tears flowing out
They never dry up</i></b>

01:19:39.300 --> 01:19:40.650
<b>--This can't get much worse!
She's awoken it!
--<i>I let the words of a curse
Be my deliverance</i></b>

01:19:40.650 --> 01:19:42.580
<b>--The ancient Demon King, given form
--<i>I let the words of a curse
Be my deliverance</i></b>

01:19:42.580 --> 01:19:43.360
<b>--by the song of a Sing-Sing Fruit user...
--<i>I let the words of a curse
Be my deliverance</i></b>

01:19:43.350 --> 01:19:45.780
<b>--by the song of a Sing-Sing Fruit user...
--<i>ᛗᛁᛖ ᚾᛖᚷ ᛟᚾ ᚷᛁᛖᚲ ᚷᛁᛖᚲ
ᚾᚨᚺ ᛈᚺᚨᛋ ᛏᛖᛉᛉᛖ ᛚᚨᚺ</i></b>

01:19:45.770 --> 01:19:47.420
<b>--<i>ᛗᛁᛖ ᚾᛖᚷ ᛟᚾ ᚷᛁᛖᚲ ᚷᛁᛖᚲ
ᚾᚨᚺ ᛈᚺᚨᛋ ᛏᛖᛉᛉᛖ ᛚᚨᚺ</i></b>

01:19:47.420 --> 01:19:49.240
<b>--...Tot Musica!
--<i>ᛗᛁᛖ ᚾᛖᚷ ᛟᚾ ᚷᛁᛖᚲ ᚷᛁᛖᚲ
ᚾᚨᚺ ᛈᚺᚨᛋ ᛏᛖᛉᛉᛖ ᛚᚨᚺ</i></b>

01:19:50.240 --> 01:19:53.910
<b><i>These ancient words
like a hymn of reclamation</i></b>

01:19:54.040 --> 01:19:56.950
<b><i>Not even death will escape them</i></b>

01:19:57.080 --> 01:20:03.210
<b><i>How to center these
troubled thoughts? I pray</i></b>

01:20:04.460 --> 01:20:10.970
<b><i>Can the future bring calm
to the sea? I beg</i></b>

01:20:11.090 --> 01:20:14.720
<b><i>Keep making this music
'til you breathe your last</i></b>

01:20:14.850 --> 01:20:18.270
<b><i>We dream but never lose sight of the past</i></b>

01:20:18.390 --> 01:20:21.850
<b><i>Illuminate hope and forget all the rest</i></b>

01:20:21.980 --> 01:20:25.780
<b><i>Nothing left but to yell, yeah, yeah</i></b>

01:20:25.900 --> 01:20:29.450
<b><i>It's time for salvation to finally come</i></b>

01:20:29.570 --> 01:20:33.160
<b><i>I feel this rage, and I'm feelin' it strong</i></b>

