01:23:06.690 --> 01:23:09.730
<b>Hey! I bet you can hear me now, Uta!</b>

01:23:09.860 --> 01:23:11.110
<b>This is all--</b>

01:23:11.230 --> 01:23:12.230
<b>Luffy-senpai!</b>

01:23:16.360 --> 01:23:17.200
<b>Luffy!</b>

01:23:17.320 --> 01:23:18.990
<b>What are you doing?! Fight back!</b>

01:23:19.320 --> 01:23:21.620
<b>Uta! Listen to me!</b>

01:23:25.710 --> 01:23:27.460
<b>Uta... we need to talk...</b>

01:23:27.710 --> 01:23:31.500
<b>I have nothing to say... to a pirate!</b>

01:23:37.300 --> 01:23:37.970
<b>Old guy!</b>

01:23:38.090 --> 01:23:38.720
<b>Bepo?!</b>

01:23:38.840 --> 01:23:45.520
<b>I cannot let Uta hurt any more of her friends...</b>

01:23:45.640 --> 01:23:48.390
<b>But this dummy still believes in Shanks.</b>

01:23:48.520 --> 01:23:51.690
<b>You're wrong, Uta. I lied...</b>

01:23:51.980 --> 01:23:58.780
<b>Twelve years ago... on that night, it wasn't the
Red-Haired Pirates who destroyed Elegia...</b>

01:24:00.570 --> 01:24:02.070
<b>It was Tot Musica!</b>

01:24:03.830 --> 01:24:08.290
<b>I'm sorry... that I never
told you the truth before.</b>

01:24:09.290 --> 01:24:13.130
<b>Do you remember the party from that day?</b>

01:24:13.540 --> 01:24:18.010
<b>When the musicians of the city learned,
you were leaving with Shanks,</b>

01:24:18.130 --> 01:24:21.220
<b>they realized it was their last-chance
and had you sing non-stop.</b>

01:24:21.590 --> 01:24:28.730
<b>and arranged it so that your singing
would play throughout the land.</b>

01:24:29.480 --> 01:24:31.400
<b>And that was a mistake.</b>

01:24:33.270 --> 01:24:39.740
<b>That singing beckoned to a score that
had been sealed deep under the castle!</b>

01:24:47.160 --> 01:24:50.210
<b>That score... was Tot Musica...</b>

01:24:50.330 --> 01:24:54.380
<b>It found its way to your side and tempted you</b>

01:24:54.500 --> 01:24:58.300
<b>so that it would be set free
with your Sing-Sing Fruit powers!</b>

01:25:04.680 --> 01:25:09.020
<b>With the seal on the Demon King
broken, he absorbed you,</b>

01:25:09.140 --> 01:25:12.440
<b>and unleashed his wrath on the country!</b>

01:25:17.070 --> 01:25:20.150
<b>Snap out of it, Uta!
Don't let him take you!</b>

01:25:35.840 --> 01:25:38.750
<b>Your youth ended up saving us.</b>

01:25:38.880 --> 01:25:41.220
<b>You were exhausted and fell asleep.</b>

01:25:41.880 --> 01:25:44.430
<b>But... the country was...</b>

01:25:53.100 --> 01:25:55.350
<b>The Navy is already here.</b>

01:25:55.730 --> 01:25:58.270
<b>Would you mind keeping this a secret from Uta?</b>

01:25:58.440 --> 01:26:01.190
<b>It'd be cruel to tell her the truth.</b>

01:26:01.320 --> 01:26:04.950
<b>Right. I'll tell the Navy
that I was responsible.</b>

01:26:05.070 --> 01:26:07.240
<b>Nah. It should be us.</b>

01:26:07.780 --> 01:26:12.660
<b>"Red-Haired" Shanks and his crew,
the Red-Haired Pirates, did this.</b>

01:26:13.040 --> 01:26:14.460
<b>Tell that to Uta, too.</b>

01:26:16.080 --> 01:26:18.250
<b>You're going to leave her...?</b>

01:26:18.380 --> 01:26:20.840
<b>The girl's got a hell of a voice.</b>

01:26:20.960 --> 01:26:25.890
<b>We can't keep her cooped up on a boat
while we're on the run from the Navy.</b>

01:26:26.260 --> 01:26:30.350
<b>Please. Make her into the 
greatest singer in the world.</b>

01:26:30.850 --> 01:26:33.600
<b>Her singing isn't a crime.</b>

01:26:33.890 --> 01:26:35.390
<b>Shanks...</b>

01:26:36.900 --> 01:26:38.270
<b>I understand!</b>

01:26:38.400 --> 01:26:44.070
<b>As the king of Elegia, I, Gordon, swear upon
the love my subjects felt for music!</b>

01:26:44.280 --> 01:26:50.280
<b>I will turn Uta into a sublime singer,
who will spread joy to the entire world!</b>

01:26:52.450 --> 01:26:59.540
<b>Uta... even when we're apart,
you'll always be my daughter, so...<i></i></b>

01:26:59.840 --> 01:27:05.300
<b>Let's part with a smile!
Our beloved musician is setting off on her own!</b>

01:27:09.470 --> 01:27:11.390
<b>Uta! You heard him!</b>

01:27:12.770 --> 01:27:14.270
<b>I knew Shanks was a good guy!</b>

01:27:33.160 --> 01:27:36.040
<b>That's... my old drawing!</b>

01:27:41.090 --> 01:27:43.750
<b>It's done! Boom!</b>

01:27:43.920 --> 01:27:45.010
<b>What is it?</b>

01:27:45.260 --> 01:27:47.340
<b>It's Shanks' straw hat!</b>

01:27:48.220 --> 01:27:49.180
<b>A hat?</b>

01:27:49.390 --> 01:27:50.390
<b>Yeah!</b>

01:27:52.300 --> 01:27:53.140
<b>You suck.</b>

01:27:53.260 --> 01:27:55.810
<b>Let's make it the mark of our new age!</b>

01:27:55.930 --> 01:27:57.730
<b>You take that. Don't lose it!</b>

01:28:01.710 --> 01:28:02.850
<b>Stop, Uta.</b>

01:28:03.980 --> 01:28:05.860
<b>This isn't freedom.</b>

01:28:07.320 --> 01:28:09.360
<b>This isn't a new age!</b>

01:28:10.820 --> 01:28:14.240
<b>You know that better than anyone!</b>

01:28:17.100 --> 01:28:17.960
<b>Luffy--</b>

01:28:19.620 --> 01:28:21.540
<b>--Luffy!
--We're too late...</b>

01:28:29.430 --> 01:28:31.470
<b>What is this?</b>

01:28:34.970 --> 01:28:37.560
<b>Get in here if you want to be safe!</b>

01:28:37.680 --> 01:28:40.520
<b>Hey! How the hell are we
supposed to fight that thing?!</b>

01:28:40.640 --> 01:28:43.860
<b>If we just knew how to time
the simultaneous attacks...!</b>

01:28:57.580 --> 01:29:00.910
<b>Well, isn't that funny?</b>

01:29:01.040 --> 01:29:06.130
<b>The Navy's ready to kill civilians
and the pirates are protecting them.</b>

01:29:06.250 --> 01:29:09.210
<b>I don't think titles matter right now.</b>

01:29:09.470 --> 01:29:11.590
<b>Why protect them all?</b>

01:29:11.720 --> 01:29:15.550
<b>Because our daughter doesn't need
anything else on her conscience!</b>

01:29:17.010 --> 01:29:19.980
<b>All, right, you bozos!
Nobody else dies today!</b>

01:29:22.390 --> 01:29:26.980
<b>Stopping the Demon King might be faster...</b>

01:29:29.820 --> 01:29:32.360
<b>Uta's been eating Wake-shrooms.</b>

01:29:32.490 --> 01:29:36.200
<b>If she's been consumed by Tot Musica,
I'm not sure how she can be stopped...</b>

01:29:37.910 --> 01:29:39.870
<b>--Uta...
--You did it!
--It was your fault.</b>

01:29:40.000 --> 01:29:41.870
<b>--You did this!
--You're guilty...</b>

01:29:42.000 --> 01:29:45.080
<b>Shut up! I knew the truth!</b>

01:29:46.000 --> 01:29:51.170
<b>It happened a year after I started
singing for everyone...</b>

01:29:51.470 --> 01:29:55.510
<b>I found a Transponder Snail that recorded
what had happened on that day.</b>

01:29:56.850 --> 01:29:59.600
<b>If you're watching this, look out!</b>

01:29:59.720 --> 01:30:01.560
<b>The girl named Uta is dangerous!</b>

01:30:01.680 --> 01:30:04.270
<b>Her song can destroy the world!</b>

01:30:04.810 --> 01:30:07.310
<b>But what was I supposed to do at that point?!</b>

01:30:07.440 --> 01:30:10.480
<b>The whole world is waiting
for my singing already!</b>

01:30:10.650 --> 01:30:13.740
<b>Please, Uta. I don't want to be here anymore.</b>

01:30:13.860 --> 01:30:18.200
<b>Isn't there a world where I can just listen
to your singing all the time?</b>

01:30:18.330 --> 01:30:21.580
<b>That's right! I'm Uta and I hate pirates!</b>

01:30:21.700 --> 01:30:24.290
<b>For all the people who found me...</b>

01:30:24.620 --> 01:30:26.920
<b>I can't turn back anymore!</b>

01:30:27.040 --> 01:30:28.250
<b>For the new age--!</b>

01:30:30.840 --> 01:30:32.670
<b>Heat Goat!</b>

01:30:38.350 --> 01:30:39.760
<b>Big Brother Oven!</b>

01:30:39.890 --> 01:30:40.850
<b>Look out!</b>

01:30:44.230 --> 01:30:46.980
<b>Can't let a lady get hurt, can I?</b>

01:30:47.980 --> 01:30:51.320
<b>Besides, there's something
only you can do...</b>

01:30:51.440 --> 01:30:52.320
<b>Right!</b>

01:30:53.940 --> 01:30:55.900
<b>Koby, take command!</b>

01:30:56.030 --> 01:30:58.240
<b>Right! Defensive formation!</b>

01:30:58.700 --> 01:31:00.830
<b>Our main priority is protecting the audience!</b>

01:31:00.950 --> 01:31:04.000
<b>Nami-san, Robin-san
please help organize the evacuation!</b>

01:31:04.330 --> 01:31:07.500
<b>Ladies and gentlemen,
proceed calmly into the mirror!</b>

01:31:07.620 --> 01:31:09.210
<b>Brulee-san is at the center of this operation!</b>

01:31:09.330 --> 01:31:11.500
<b>Blueno-san, take your team and protect her!</b>

01:31:11.920 --> 01:31:14.010
<b>Franky-san, Jimbei-san, guard our flanks!</b>

01:31:14.130 --> 01:31:17.590
<b>Chopper-san, keep Luffy-san
and Gordon-san safe!</b>

01:31:17.720 --> 01:31:20.220
<b>Helmeppo-san and I will join flank guard!</b>

01:31:20.350 --> 01:31:23.140
<b>Usopp-san, provide fire support from the rear!</b>

01:31:23.270 --> 01:31:26.560
<b>Brook-san, Sanji-san,
you'll be frontline defense!</b>

01:31:26.690 --> 01:31:31.690
