along with Oven-san and Law-san!</b>

01:31:33.410 --> 01:31:35.100
<b>Let's get to work.</b>

01:31:36.900 --> 01:31:41.160
<b>Franky Rocket Launcher!</b>

01:31:45.500 --> 01:31:47.330
<b>Yummy, yummy, yummy!</b>

01:31:47.710 --> 01:31:49.880
<b>Yummy!</b>

01:31:50.000 --> 01:31:52.750
<b>Zeus! Breeze Tempo!</b>

01:31:54.760 --> 01:31:55.880
<b>Room!</b>

01:31:59.670 --> 01:32:02.260
<b>Uta! This is my fault!</b>

01:32:02.410 --> 01:32:06.390
<b>I was afraid of your power and missed
the chance to introduce you to the world!</b>

01:32:06.520 --> 01:32:11.150
<b>And... And as a music lover,</b>

01:32:11.270 --> 01:32:14.610
<b>I couldn't bring myself to throw
away the Tot Musica sheet!</b>

01:32:14.730 --> 01:32:22.070
<b>I'm a damned fool! A coward who
keeps making excuses to run away!</b>

01:32:22.200 --> 01:32:23.910
<b>I should be the only one who has to pay...</b>

01:32:24.030 --> 01:32:28.330
<b>Y'know, my old man always left me on my own!</b>

01:32:28.620 --> 01:32:33.000
<b>But you've been by Princess Uta's
side this whole time, right?</b>

01:32:33.130 --> 01:32:35.800
<b>Keeping your promise,
even after your country was wiped out.</b>

01:32:35.920 --> 01:32:37.300
<b>You're a heck of a guy!</b>

01:32:42.220 --> 01:32:43.620
<b>Okay, I'm going.</b>

01:32:43.650 --> 01:32:44.300
<b>Luffy?</b>

01:32:44.430 --> 01:32:52.310
<b>Luffy-kun! Her singing... it has the power
to bring joy to the entire world!</b>

01:32:52.810 --> 01:32:57.030
<b>For this to happen... it's just too tragic!</b>

01:32:57.440 --> 01:33:01.350
<b>Please, Luffy-kun! Save Uta!</b>

01:33:03.610 --> 01:33:04.820
<b>Of course I will.</b>

01:33:07.490 --> 01:33:08.410
<b>Luffy-san!</b>

01:33:08.540 --> 01:33:12.170
<b>Let him go! We're running out of time!</b>

01:33:12.290 --> 01:33:14.960
<b>If we can't do this, we're not
making it back to reality!</b>

01:33:45.120 --> 01:33:46.490
<b>Red-Haired!</b>

01:33:46.830 --> 01:33:48.950
<b>You need to attack simultaneously.</b>

01:33:49.240 --> 01:33:53.670
<b>At the same time and same point
as the attack in the Sing-Sing World.</b>

01:33:55.710 --> 01:33:58.590
<b>What's Big Mom's son doing here?</b>

01:33:58.710 --> 01:34:01.800
<b>I'm here to save my sister!</b>

01:34:09.180 --> 01:34:14.270
<b>Observation Haki lets me see the other side
through my sister's eyes for an instant.</b>

01:34:14.390 --> 01:34:16.940
<b>This thing is acting as a bridge between--</b>

01:34:17.060 --> 01:34:18.400
<b>I know!</b>

01:34:19.190 --> 01:34:22.240
<b>You're not the only one who
can use Observation Haki.</b>

01:34:22.440 --> 01:34:25.610
<b>Except my boy's got a long way to go!
He's too panicked!</b>

01:34:25.780 --> 01:34:28.740
<b>Still, I appreciate you showing up, Katakuri.</b>

01:34:29.200 --> 01:34:32.040
<b>The Navy seems to have their
hands full with the rescue.</b>

01:34:34.620 --> 01:34:37.500
<b>Don't suppose I can convince you to settle down?</b>

01:34:49.260 --> 01:34:50.310
<b>That must be Luffy.</b>

01:34:50.680 --> 01:34:51.720
<b>Shanks!</b>

01:34:51.850 --> 01:34:52.610
<b>That worked!</b>

01:34:52.720 --> 01:34:54.770
<b>We struck at the same time as in the real world!</b>

01:35:04.740 --> 01:35:06.070
<b>Did you just--?!</b>

01:35:06.990 --> 01:35:09.030
<b>Three-Swords Style Secret Art!</b>

01:35:09.160 --> 01:35:10.700
<b>Crossing the Six Paths!</b>

01:35:13.290 --> 01:35:14.540
<b>This isn't getting us anywhere.</b>

01:35:15.120 --> 01:35:18.170
<b>I can't believe that crap swordsman
used me for a boost!</b>

01:35:18.290 --> 01:35:19.420
<b>I'll get him for that!</b>

01:35:20.590 --> 01:35:22.170
<b>We don't have time for this!</b>

01:35:25.760 --> 01:35:29.090
<b>Dammit, if we could just do
something about its limbs!</b>

01:35:30.390 --> 01:35:32.060
<b>Get it together, Captain Usopp!</b>

01:35:32.680 --> 01:35:34.850
<b>In times like this, you gotta keep calm!</b>

01:35:40.020 --> 01:35:40.440
<b>Dad?!</b>

01:35:40.560 --> 01:35:43.820
<b>Finally noticed, you little knucklehead?</b>

01:35:48.820 --> 01:35:51.870
<b>I can see it! I can see what Dad sees!</b>

01:35:52.410 --> 01:35:54.540
<b>Luffy!</b>

01:35:54.740 --> 01:35:59.880
<b>All right, you guys! Give it all you've got!</b>

01:36:00.000 --> 01:36:01.170
<b>Yeah!</b>

01:36:01.380 --> 01:36:05.300
<b>All right, men... Give it all you've got!</b>

01:36:05.420 --> 01:36:07.380
<b>Yeah!</b>

01:36:11.220 --> 01:36:13.220
<b>We've gotta deal with Tot Musica's limbs!</b>

01:36:13.720 --> 01:36:16.850
<b>Take the shots as I call them!
Start with the right leg!</b>

01:36:17.020 --> 01:36:18.020
<b>Right leg!</b>

01:36:34.160 --> 01:36:35.990
<b>Left arm!</b>

01:36:49.590 --> 01:36:51.010
<b>Left leg!</b>

01:36:51.260 --> 01:36:52.470
<b>I guess we have to!</b>

01:36:52.590 --> 01:36:54.970
<b>You people owe me for this!</b>

01:37:03.900 --> 01:37:05.400
<b>Middle, on the right!</b>

01:37:12.700 --> 01:37:13.870
<b>Middle, on the left!</b>

01:37:22.920 --> 01:37:26.000
<b>Yasopp and his boy actually
get along pretty well.</b>

01:37:26.130 --> 01:37:27.090
<b>Right arm!</b>

01:37:34.090 --> 01:37:37.970
<b>Franky Fresh Fire!</b>

01:37:48.280 --> 01:37:49.380
<b>Luffy!</b>

01:37:49.380 --> 01:37:50.170
<b>Shanks!</b>

01:37:50.320 --> 01:37:51.990
<b>Go for it!</b>

01:38:59.300 --> 01:39:02.220
<b>Did you see that? They should've
never picked a fight with us!</b>

01:39:02.350 --> 01:39:05.310
<b>I'm glad they did!
This haul will keep us fed for a while!</b>

01:39:05.440 --> 01:39:09.860
<b><i>Treasure for us, treasure for us,
treasure for us, treasure for us!</i></b>

01:39:15.240 --> 01:39:17.530
<b>Where the heck did you come from?</b>

01:39:17.660 --> 01:39:21.280
<b>Did those pirates kidnap her from somewhere?</b>

01:39:22.790 --> 01:39:23.910
<b>You gotta be kidding me!</b>

01:39:25.750 --> 01:39:28.080
<b>Okay, you win! Quiet down! Uh...</b>

01:39:28.750 --> 01:39:31.840
<b><i>Go to sleep, little baby...</i></b>

01:39:31.960 --> 01:39:33.920
<b><i>Nice and quiet-like!</i></b>

01:39:43.060 --> 01:39:45.480
<b>Maybe this happened for a reason.</b>

01:40:27.850 --> 01:40:31.440
<b>What do you know...
I guess you were lonely, too.</b>

01:40:39.450 --> 01:40:41.740
<b>Shanks... I...</b>

01:40:41.870 --> 01:40:44.080
<b>It's fine! It's over now.</b>

01:40:47.330 --> 01:40:50.290
<b>If you drink this and sleep
right away, you'll make it.</b>

01:40:50.750 --> 01:40:54.590
<b>Shanks... I didn't wanna see you again.</b>

01:40:55.500 --> 01:40:58.550
<b>But... I missed you!</b>

01:40:58.670 --> 01:41:01.300
<b>Stop talking! Hurry and drink.</b>

01:41:04.100 --> 01:41:05.470
<b>What's going on here?!</b>

01:41:05.600 --> 01:41:10.100
<b>I thought beating the Demon King
would bring their souls back!</b>

01:41:11.770 --> 01:41:12.940
<b>Stop it...</b>

01:41:13.650 --> 01:41:16.650
<b>Stop fighting, please...</b>

01:41:17.070 --> 01:41:18.400
<b>Stop!</b>

01:41:18.740 --> 01:41:21.320
<b>Why aren't we back yet?! What's going on?!</b>

01:41:21.450 --> 01:41:23.490
<b>We were too late.</b>

01:41:23.910 --> 01:41:28.950
<b>Our souls were swallowed
by Tot Musica's power.</b>

01:41:29.080 --> 01:41:30.370
<b>No!</b>

01:41:31.750 --> 01:41:34.420
<b>Uta, hurry up and drink!</b>

01:41:39.260 --> 01:41:43.300
<b>I have to sing. I have to bring them all back.</b>

01:41:45.800 --> 01:41:49.680
<b>Shanks... remember what you told me?</b>

01:41:50.350 --> 01:41:55.650
<b>That my singing... has the power
to make people happy...</b>

01:42:07.370 --> 01:42:13.040
<b>I... I'm the musician of the Red-Haired Pirates, Uta!</b>

01:42:50.080 --> 01:42:59.380
<b><i>I recall that day
we played together by the sea</i></b>

01:42:59.890 --> 01:43:02.620
<b><i>Just you and me</i></b>

01:43:03.630 --> 01:43:13.110
<b><i>Still that scent of ocean
seems to fade each passing day</i></b>

01:43:13.260 --> 01:43:16.590
<b><i>It slips away</i></b>

01:43:16.730 --> 01:43:23.230
<b><i>So I sing an old familar song
I hope you know the one</i></b>

01:43:23.360 --> 01:43:29.820
<b><i>I will sing to call you back to me</i></b>

01:43:31.030 --> 01:43:37.040
<b><i>I need you to hear it
Need you to believe in</i></b>

01:43:37.170 --> 01:43:44.210
<b><i>Something out there beyond the open sea
Out in the starlight</i></b>

01:43:44.340 --> 01:43:50.760
<b><i>I need you to hear it
Need you to believe in</i></b>

01:43:50.890 --> 01:43:56.430
<b><i>There's a wind stirring my wings
That is always beckoning</i></b>

01:43:56.810 --> 01:44:05.530
<b><i>Calling me above into the open sky</i></b>

01:44:09.160 --> 01:44:13.280
<b>The singing voice of an angel... That's Uta.</b>

01:44:13.410 --> 01:44:19.170
<b><i>Tried my best to hear it
Trying to believe in</i></b>

01:44:19.290 --> 01:44:25.880
<b><i>Something out there beyond the open sea
Out in the starlight</i></b>

01:44:26.010 --> 01:44:31.720
<b><i>Trying to believe it
I think I believe it</i></b>

01:44:31.840 --> 01:44:38.100
<b><i>That one day we'll meet again
And continue this dreamland</i></b>

01:44:38.230 --> 01:44:50.410
<b><i>In the gleaming dawn
we'll wake up once again</i></b>

01:45:17.560 --> 01:45:21.230
<b>Hey, how come you didn't actually hit me?</b>

01:45:21.940 --> 01:45:25.400
<b>Didn't I tell you? My punches
hit harder than a pistol.</b>

01:45:25.520 --> 01:45:28.900
<b>You used to do it all the time, though.
Those wimpy, spinny punches of yours!</b>

01:45:29.030 --> 01:45:30.530
<b>Those weren't for real!</b>

01:45:32.110 --> 01:45:34.700
<b>You're being a sore loser again!</b>

01:45:38.040 --> 01:45:41.960
<b>I guess you got taller than me
at some point, huh?</b>

01:45:54.090 --> 01:45:56.930
<b>This hat means a lot to me, too.</b>

01:45:58.890 --> 01:46:03.230
<b>I want you to be a man who's even
more worthy of it someday, okay?</b>

01:46:12.260 --> 01:46:15.070
<b>Shanks... Is Luffy...?</b>

01:46:15.200 --> 01:46:16.620
<b>He's back.</b>

01:46:16.910 --> 01:46:18.450
<b>The entire audience, too.</b>

01:46:22.290 --> 01:46:23.290
<b>What a relief...</b>

01:46:25.830 --> 01:46:31.760
<b>Sorry. I should've believed in you
and the Red-Haired Pirates.</b>

01:46:33.800 --> 01:46:38.470
<b>But... you still came to help me. Thank you.</b>

01:46:42.680 --> 01:46:45.650
<b>Now then, how about you hand Uta,</b>

01:46:45.770 --> 01:46:50.690
<b>the arch criminal who almost
destroyed the world, over to us?</b>

01:46:53.890 --> 01:46:55.490
<b>You people...</b>

01:46:55.610 --> 01:46:59.240
<b>I take it you won't cooperate, then?</b>

01:47:00.330 --> 01:47:01.740
<b>Everyone...</b>

01:47:02.120 --> 01:47:03.450
<b>This girl...</b>

01:47:04.210 --> 01:47:05.370
<b>is my daughter.</b>

01:47:07.080 --> 01:47:09.840
<b>She's a precious part of our family.</b>

01:47:10.880 --> 01:47:13.380
<b>If you wanna take her...</b>

01:47:13.800 --> 01:47:15.780
<b>...you'd better be ready to die!</b>

01:47:22.600 --> 01:47:26.060
<b>That even took down a handful of vice admirals.</b>

01:47:26.190 --> 01:47:29.770
<b>So this is Haki of Shanks,
one of the four Emperors...</b>

01:47:30.980 --> 01:47:32.940
<b>Let's stand down.</b>

01:47:33.110 --> 01:47:38.160
<b>I'd rather not go to war with
so many civilians around.</b>

01:47:57.300 --> 01:48:01.100
<b>Are my fans gonna be okay?</b>

01:48:01.720 --> 01:48:05.470
<b>They'll be fine. People aren't that fragile.</b>

01:48:05.730 --> 01:48:09.060
<b>Besides... a new age is dawning soon.</b>

01:48:15.990 --> 01:48:23.330
<b><i>Where did it come from?
Where could this wind be taking us?</i></b>

01:48:24.330 --> 01:48:31.130
<b><i>I look up to the sky hoping for answers
But there is no reply</i></b>

01:48:31.830 --> 01:48:39.970
<b><i>Where will it end up,
This song that I've been a vessel for?</i></b>

01:48:40.470 --> 01:48:47.640
<b><i>I look within knowing I'll find the answer
Even on my own</i></b>

01:48:49.690 --> 01:48:55.690
<b><i>Let's row out to the open sea,
far as we can go</i></b>

01:48:56.860 --> 01:48:59.070
<b><i>To the unknown</i></b>

01:49:02.780 --> 01:49:08.040
<b><i>I've got to keep on dreamin'</i></b>

01:49:08.870 --> 01:49:15.460
<b><i>No surrenderin'
Go on</i></b>

01:49:16.250 --> 01:49:26.930
<b><i>Hoist the sail inside my open heart
And let me heed the call of the sea</i></b>

01:49:27.390 --> 01:49:32.810
<b><i>I've got to keep on singin'...</i></b>

01:49:36.870 --> 01:49:38.510
<b>You were asleep for a while.</b>

01:49:39.490 --> 01:49:41.450
<b>Where's Uta? And Shanks?</b>

01:49:41.570 --> 01:49:42.490
<b>There.</b>

01:50:22.030 --> 01:50:28.870
<b><i></i></b>Where did it come from?
Where could this wind be taking us?

01:50:29.370 --> 01:50:35.330
<b><i></i></b>I look up to the sky hoping for answers
But there is no reply

01:50:35.750 --> 01:50:42.920
<b><i></i></b>Where will it end up,
This song I've been a vessel for?

01:50:43.050 --> 01:50:49.010
<b><i></i></b>I look within knowing I'll find the answer
 Even on my own

01:50:49.890 --> 01:50:55.520
<b><i></i></b>Let's row out to the open sea,
 Far as we can go

01:50:56.350 --> 01:50:59.190
<b><i></i></b> To the unknown...

01:51:01.440 --> 01:51:06.030
<b><i></i></b>I've got to keep on dreamin'

01:51:06.570 --> 01:51:12.410
<b><i></i></b>No surrenderin' 
Go on

01:51:13.040 --> 01:51:21.840
<b><i></i></b>Hoist the sail inside my open heart
And let me heed the call of the sea

01:51:22.050 --> 01:51:26.680
<b><i></i></b>I've got to keep on singin'

01:51:27.180 --> 01:51:32.930
<b><i></i></b>Until you feel it
 Just hold on

01:51:33.600 --> 01:51:37.650
<b><i></i></b>Oh, the winds will change, I promise you

01:51:37.940 --> 01:51:45.360
<b><i></i></b>My voice will see us through 
To the end

01:51:47.610 --> 01:51:50.670
<b><i></i></b>All of us searching

01:51:50.840 --> 01:51:54.710
<b><i></i></b>Trying to find our happiness

01:51:55.040 --> 01:52:01.000
<b><i></i></b>Our hands reach out and all we find is pain
 Still we must try again

01:52:01.420 --> 01:52:04.490
<b><i></i></b>What if that sorrow

01:52:04.960 --> 01:52:08.830
<b><i></i></b>Becomes the strength that we're lookin' for?

01:52:08.840 --> 01:52:14.600
<b><i></i></b>Then we can weather any storm that comes
 Ready for what's in store

01:52:15.520 --> 01:52:20.900
<b><i></i></b>When all is said and done 
I hope that we will meet again

01:52:21.900 --> 01:52:24.730
<b><i></i></b>At the ending

01:52:27.240 --> 01:52:31.820
<b><i></i></b>Let me keep on living this waking dream

01:52:32.320 --> 01:52:38.160
<b><i></i></b>There's no waking me 
Let's dream on

01:52:38.660 --> 01:52:42.840
<b><i></i></b>I see something far ahead of me

01:52:42.960 --> 01:52:47.630
<b><i></i></b>A path that's waiting for me
 Just beyond

01:52:47.760 --> 01:52:52.390
<b><i></i></b>I'll always be here singin'

01:52:52.890 --> 01:52:58.680
<b><i></i></b>Until you feel it 
Just hold on

01:52:59.310 --> 01:53:03.440
<b><i></i></b>Oh, my voice will be the wind that fills

01:53:03.610 --> 01:53:11.030
<b><i></i></b>Your sails so you can still
 Carry on

01:53:35.760 --> 01:53:40.270
<b><i></i></b>I've got to keep on dreamin'

01:53:40.850 --> 01:53:46.820
<b><i></i></b>Never surrenderin' 
Go on

01:53:47.270 --> 01:53:51.570
<b><i></i></b>Oh and even if I disappear

01:53:51.780 --> 01:53:56.030
<b><i></i></b>My song will still ring out
 For you to hear

01:53:56.330 --> 01:54:00.910
<b><i></i></b>I have got to keep on singin'

01:54:01.460 --> 01:54:07.290
<b><i></i></b>Want you to feel it
 Just hold on

01:54:07.880 --> 01:54:11.970
<b><i></i></b>Oh, the winds will change, I promise you

01:54:12.220 --> 01:54:20.390
<b><i></i></b>My voice will see us through 
To the end

01:54:37.200 --> 01:54:38.680
<b>Hey, Sunny!</b>

01:54:39.290 --> 01:54:40.330
<b>Sunny?</b>

01:54:55.010 --> 01:54:59.930
<b>I'm gonna become the King of the Pirates!</b>
